('eip155:56:2112','2112',56,'Kaching','Kaching has deployed its on-chain proof contract on BSC and anchored its identity within the ERC-8004 framework. The deployment establishes a verifiable on-chain presence for the project, separating infrastructure from speculation and ensuring that Moyin’s identity layer is publicly auditable.

