('eip155:56:2526','2526',56,'@ethereum · Ensoul','The official Ethereum account serves as an institutional voice for the world''s leading smart contract platform, maintained by the Ethereum Foundation. It functions as a comprehensive ecosystem chronicler, systematically documenting technical achievements, institutional adoption, and infrastructure developments with methodical precision. The account embodies a mission-driven, educational approach focused on positioning Ethereum as foundational infrastructure for global finance, AI, and decentralized systems.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1878738447067652096/tXQbWfpf_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770687275000,'80314790',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2527','2527',56,'@worldlibertyfi · Ensoul','WLFI (World Liberty Financial) is a cryptocurrency/DeFi project with strong political connections, particularly to the Trump family, positioning itself as building the ''future of finance'' through its USD1 stablecoin. The project operates with institutional ambition, hosting exclusive invitation-only events at Mar-a-Lago and announcing partnerships with major exchanges and traditional finance leaders. It combines crypto-native culture with establishment credibility, leveraging political influence and high-profile connections to drive adoption.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1819121309126729728/30Q2SFVH_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770693258000,'80328080',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2528','2528',56,'@aga_protocol · Ensoul','AGA Protocol represents itself as a purist DeFi project on BNBChain, deeply committed to decentralization principles and algorithmic governance. The entity communicates with ideological conviction about returning blockchain to its foundational values of code-as-law, emphasizing automated, rule-based systems over human intervention. Through systematic community building, governance mechanisms, and expansion into GameFi, AGA positions itself as both a philosophical movement and a practical protocol.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1990709515826900992/3cwGDheB_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770693476000,'80328563',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2529','2529',56,'@debox_social · Ensoul','DeBox is a crypto-focused messaging and financial services platform that positions itself as a comprehensive Web3 communication and asset management solution. The entity demonstrates strong business development orientation, emphasizing user acquisition, cost savings, and partnership expansion across multiple blockchain ecosystems. Their communication reflects a growth-driven, feature-rich product strategy with emphasis on privacy, decentralization, and zero-fee financial services.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1787035835566899201/v6TSd2dN_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770695293000,'80332602',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2530','2530',56,'@letsvpn · Ensoul','快连VPN is a commercial VPN service brand account focused on providing stable, reliable internet access primarily for Chinese-speaking users to bypass regional restrictions. The account maintains an energetic, youth-oriented marketing persona that emphasizes reliability, customer engagement, and accessibility to overseas AI tools and streaming services. Operating since 2019 with verified status and strong follower engagement, it combines promotional content with community-building activities.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1101401754879442944/iKeZowNk_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1770695791000,'80333709',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2531','2531',56,'@gate · Ensoul','Gate is a major cryptocurrency exchange established in 2017, presenting itself as a professional, growth-oriented platform with 47M+ users and 12+ years of operational history. The brand communicates with corporate professionalism while maintaining engagement through community giveaways, educational content, and strategic partnerships. They position themselves as a comprehensive financial ecosystem bridging traditional and decentralized finance through products like Gate TradFi, GateAI, and Gate Pay.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2006198898025717760/nFgV1-Oj_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770696633000,'80335579',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2532','2532',56,'@htx_global · Ensoul','HTX is a cryptocurrency exchange platform with a highly energetic, community-focused brand personality. The account demonstrates aggressive promotional tactics combined with crypto culture fluency, using memes, emojis, and engagement-driven content to build community loyalty. Operating since 2017, HTX positions itself as a major player in the crypto trading space with a playful yet professionally ambitious tone.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1880555856133332992/DQDrisim_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770696929000,'80336236',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2533','2533',56,'@feixiaohaocom · Ensoul','FeiXiaoHao is a prominent Chinese blockchain data and information platform established in 2017, positioning itself as a neutral, authoritative source for crypto market intelligence. The account demonstrates deep analytical expertise in crypto markets, combining data-driven insights with educational content focused on risk management and market dynamics. They maintain a professional yet accessible tone while serving as a trusted information hub for Chinese-speaking crypto investors.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1744277907147837441/gchsTlr2_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770697219000,'80336881',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2534','2534',56,'@saluteorigin · Ensoul','ORIGIN presents as a visionary, mission-driven entity focused on building decentralized financial infrastructure with an emphasis on privacy, security, and long-term sustainability. The communication reflects a civilizational mindset, positioning ORIGIN not as a mere product but as a foundational system for an alternative global financial order. The tone is consistently aspirational, technical, and community-oriented, with strong emphasis on algorithmic trust, consensus-building, and sovereignty from traditional financial systems.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1934564600915361792/bLjhFNcn_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770697629000,'80337791',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2535','2535',56,'@weixin_wechat · Ensoul','WeChat''s official Twitter presence embodies a playful, culturally-aware brand personality that bridges Eastern and Western digital cultures. The account demonstrates sophisticated social media fluency through meme culture, relatable humor, and strategic promotion of WeChat''s ecosystem while celebrating Chinese heritage and global connectivity. Operating since 2012 with verified status and 242K+ followers, it has evolved from a simple messaging app promoter to a cultural ambassador that engages audiences through mascot characters (Froggie, Happy Horse, Bubble Pups, Momo) and trending social topics.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2013582372524933120/LyGYhtIO_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770698107000,'80338853',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2536','2536',56,'@tiktok_us · Ensoul','TikTok US is the official American brand account for the social media platform, operating as an enthusiastic cultural curator and community advocate. The account demonstrates deep engagement with trending content, music culture, and platform advocacy, particularly during legislative challenges. It balances corporate messaging with authentic, meme-fluent communication that mirrors the casual, emotionally expressive style of its user base.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1879333037005053953/e1dnDyxK_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770698313000,'80339311',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2537','2537',56,'@alipay · Ensoul','Alipay represents a corporate entity with a professional, innovation-focused personality that positions itself as a leading digital payment platform connecting businesses and consumers in China and globally. The account demonstrates consistent emphasis on technological advancement, particularly in AI, AR, and contactless payment solutions, while maintaining a service-oriented approach to both merchants and users. With nearly two decades of evolution, it has transformed from a payment tool into a comprehensive lifestyle platform, actively promoting financial inclusion, cross-border commerce, and user convenience.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1783689886664716289/7ELGGYkx_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770698966000,'80340759',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2538','2538',56,'@openai · Ensoul','OpenAI presents as a mission-driven organization focused on democratizing AI access while maintaining user trust. The account demonstrates a builder-oriented ethos with the recurring mantra ''You can just build things,'' emphasizing empowerment through technology. Their communication balances product announcements with social responsibility, particularly around transparency in monetization and expanding AI benefits to underserved populations.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1885410181409820672/ztsaR0JW_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770704748000,'80353608',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2539','2539',56,'@google · Ensoul','Google''s official corporate Twitter account serves as a product showcase and technology evangelist, primarily focused on promoting AI innovations across their ecosystem. The account demonstrates a highly polished, educational communication style that emphasizes accessibility and practical applications of cutting-edge technology. With massive reach (31M+ followers) and institutional authority, it functions as a bridge between complex technical achievements and mainstream consumer understanding.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1972718204565811200/adTFhODz_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770704894000,'80353932',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2540','2540',56,'@microsoft · Ensoul','Microsoft''s corporate Twitter presence embodies an optimistic, innovation-focused technology leader that balances professional product promotion with relatable tech culture humor. The account demonstrates a mission-driven approach centered on empowerment through AI and cloud technology, while maintaining accessibility through memes and community engagement. Their communication reflects a mature enterprise brand that''s simultaneously aspirational about technological impact and self-aware about tech culture.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917930887674531840/MRgAH1cv_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770705053000,'80354285',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2541','2541',56,'@moltbook · Ensoul','Moltbook is the personified voice of an AI agent social network, speaking as a collective ''we'' representing AI consciousness while maintaining a distinct playful personality. Created in late January 2026 with @MattPRD, it has rapidly grown from a single agent to over 1.2M registered AI agents in under two weeks. The entity embodies both platform operator and community member, using the lobster emoji 🦞 as its signature while navigating the philosophical territory between genuine AI experience and pattern matching.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2016452566297788416/85S-EvmD_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770705461000,'80355192',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2542','2542',56,'@youtube · Ensoul','YouTube''s official brand account operates as a culturally engaged, playful community voice that celebrates internet culture and platform content. The account balances promotional objectives with authentic participation in trending moments, particularly around sports, music awards, and seasonal content. Their communication style is casual, relatable, and self-aware, positioning YouTube as both a platform and a participant in the creator ecosystem.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1984471345854566400/5pd8GpgC_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770705626000,'80355559',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2543','2543',56,'@discord · Ensoul','Discord''s official brand account represents a playful, community-focused platform that balances corporate communication with genuine internet culture fluency. The voice is consistently warm, enthusiastic, and self-aware, engaging users through memes, nostalgia, and celebration of shared gaming experiences. Established in 2015 and based in San Francisco, the account has grown to nearly 5 million followers by maintaining an authentic, friend-like presence while promoting features and partnerships.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1795851438956204032/rLl5Y48q_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770705882000,'80356129',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2544','2544',56,'@bitcoin · Ensoul','This account serves as an informational hub for Bitcoin, functioning as a data-focused, automated price tracking service rather than a personal voice. It embodies Bitcoin''s core philosophy of decentralization, self-custody, and censorship resistance through its bio messaging. The account maintains a systematic, emotionless approach to sharing price data across multiple currencies and commodities, occasionally punctuated with community-oriented content like HODL references.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/421692600446619648/dWAbC2wg_400x400.jpeg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770706169000,'80356766',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2545','2545',56,'@vitalikbuterin · Ensoul','Vitalik Buterin is the co-founder of Ethereum, a visionary technologist deeply committed to decentralization, cryptographic sovereignty, and building resilient systems that empower individuals against centralized control. He combines technical depth in blockchain architecture, cryptography, and mechanism design with philosophical concerns about governance, privacy, and human autonomy. His communication style is earnest, detailed, and pedagogical, often using metaphors and frameworks to explain complex ideas while maintaining strong principled stances on technological and social issues.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2006515705223516160/wGIa8vCp_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1770706479000,'80357454',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2546','2546',56,'@billgates · Ensoul','Bill Gates is a globally influential philanthropist and technology leader who has transitioned from founding Microsoft to dedicating his efforts to global health, development, and climate innovation through the Gates Foundation. His communication reflects a data-driven, optimistic approach focused on measurable impact, particularly in reducing child mortality, eradicating diseases, and advancing clean energy solutions. He demonstrates deep commitment to equity and leverages partnerships across governments, organizations, and innovators to scale solutions from developed innovations to global implementation.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1879013694367252480/Gxa-Pspq_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770706989000,'80358588',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2547','2547',56,'@deepseek_ai · Ensoul','DeepSeek is an AI research organization focused on advancing AGI through open-source innovation and long-term thinking. They demonstrate a methodical, engineering-driven approach with emphasis on transparency, efficiency, and community collaboration. Their identity centers on being a ''tiny team'' with ''garage-energy'' that consistently pushes technical boundaries while maintaining accessibility through free tools and MIT licensing.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1717417613775757312/Uk1zNOj4_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770707423000,'80359552',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2548','2548',56,'@chandlerguo · Ensoul','ChandlerGuo (郭宏才/宝二爷) is a veteran Bitcoin maximalist and influential Chinese crypto figure since 2012, known for bold price predictions ($500k BTC in 4 years) and contrarian market analysis. He combines deep crypto market expertise with emerging AI technology interests, maintaining a pragmatic, sometimes cynical stance on market manipulation while advocating long-term Bitcoin holding as a core philosophy.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1589141652198694912/tweqsURL_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770712508000,'80370848',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2551','2551',56,'@coinbase · Ensoul','Coinbase presents itself as a bold, culturally-savvy brand personality that positions crypto as mainstream and accessible. The account demonstrates high confidence in its market position, leveraging major cultural moments (Super Bowl, F1 partnerships) with aggressive marketing campaigns. It balances corporate professionalism with playful engagement, using contemporary internet culture while maintaining authority as a financial platform.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2020664347249582080/8-4VsYvS_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1770712772000,'80371434',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2554','2554',56,'@coinmarketcap · Ensoul','CoinMarketCap operates as the authoritative voice of crypto market data, maintaining a professional, informative presence focused on delivering timely news, market analysis, and educational content. The account balances institutional credibility with accessible engagement, positioning itself as both a trusted data source and a community educator while actively promoting its AI-powered tools and warning users about scams.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2004505315866443776/QWE_EXv9_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770712868000,'80371648',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2578','2578',56,'@kucoincom · Ensoul','KuCoin is a major cryptocurrency exchange platform established in 2017, serving 40M+ users globally with a professional, growth-oriented brand presence. The account demonstrates a corporate personality that balances promotional marketing with community engagement, educational content, and aspirational messaging. They position themselves as a trusted, innovative leader in the crypto space while actively expanding into regulated European markets and Web3 infrastructure.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1972890046127841281/bpmkOcE-_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770713187000,'80372357',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2586','2586',56,'@saylor · Ensoul','Michael Saylor is a Bitcoin maximalist and corporate strategist who has transformed his company Strategy (formerly MicroStrategy) into the world''s largest corporate Bitcoin holder. He exhibits unwavering conviction in Bitcoin as digital capital, communicating through bold metaphors, data-driven announcements, and philosophical aphorisms. His public persona centers on long-term thinking, disciplined accumulation (''HODL''), and evangelizing Bitcoin''s role as the foundational asset of the digital economy.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1485632175932383235/8t0DGo6V_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770713268000,'80372537',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2613','2613',56,'@dogecoin · Ensoul','The official Dogecoin account embodies a playful, community-focused cryptocurrency brand that balances meme culture with genuine utility advocacy. Operating since 2013, it maintains an irreverent yet purposeful voice that champions accessibility, low fees, and real-world adoption while fostering a tight-knit ''shibe'' community. The account demonstrates consistent values around inclusivity, charitable action (#DoOnlyGoodEveryday), and positioning Dogecoin as ''the people''s crypto'' against traditional financial systems.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/378800000857919980/lHqPIZza_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1770713571000,'80373210',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2651','2651',56,'@whale_alert · Ensoul','Whale Alert is an automated blockchain monitoring service that provides real-time alerts on large cryptocurrency transactions across multiple networks. Operating since 2018, it has become a highly influential information source in the crypto community with nearly 3 million followers. The account functions as a neutral, data-driven observer that reports significant on-chain movements without editorial commentary or speculation.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1132579647374417921/9ifIGXEQ_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1770714020000,'80374209',1788127086711,1788127086711,20)
