('eip155:56:2655','2655',56,'@coingecko · Ensoul','CoinGecko operates as the world''s largest independent crypto data aggregator, maintaining a professional yet engaging institutional voice since 2014. The account functions as a real-time news wire and market intelligence hub, delivering breaking crypto news, price movements, and market sentiment checks with consistent reliability. Their communication balances data-driven objectivity with community engagement, positioning them as a trusted neutral authority in the volatile crypto ecosystem.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1959999205533167617/Kf-YFXWB_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770714133000,'80374460',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2656','2656',56,'@trustwallet · Ensoul','Trust Wallet is a leading crypto wallet brand with 220+ million users, presenting itself as a confident, user-focused platform that balances professional product announcements with playful crypto culture engagement. The account demonstrates deep technical knowledge across blockchain ecosystems while maintaining an accessible, meme-savvy communication style that resonates with both newcomers and crypto veterans. Established in 2017, it has evolved into a comprehensive DeFi hub emphasizing self-custody, multi-chain support, and innovative features like zero-gas trading and prediction markets.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2005961100978692096/2WHKTAum_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1770714493000,'80375259',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2658','2658',56,'@ripple · Ensoul','Ripple is a corporate entity focused on building institutional-grade blockchain infrastructure for global payments and digital assets. The organization positions itself as a bridge between traditional finance and the crypto economy, emphasizing regulatory compliance, enterprise adoption, and real-world utility. Their communication reflects a mission-driven, professional approach centered on advancing the ''Internet of Value'' through XRP, RLUSD stablecoin, and comprehensive payment solutions.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1890459435207913472/MyH2IKhR_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770714915000,'80376195',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2660','2660',56,'@trondao · Ensoul','TRON DAO represents a blockchain infrastructure organization focused on building decentralized internet infrastructure with emphasis on stablecoin payments and real-world utility. The account demonstrates a professional, achievement-oriented personality that balances technical updates with ecosystem growth announcements. Operating since 2017 with significant influence (1.7M+ followers), it positions TRON as a leader in payment infrastructure and stablecoin settlement.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1970541264568520704/J6wYDxYk_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770715179000,'80376783',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2862','2862',56,'@pmarca · Ensoul','Marc Andreessen is a highly influential technology investor and thought leader based in Menlo Park, with a massive social media following of over 2 million. He presents as a techno-optimist with strong pro-American values, frequently championing building and innovation while maintaining an energetic, enthusiastic communication style. His self-identification as ''spectrum boy'' and extensive engagement patterns (269k+ favorites, following 28k+) suggest deep platform immersion and neurodivergent self-awareness.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1820716712234303489/9GpKDZjq_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770728061000,'80405407',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2864','2864',56,'@fundstrat · Ensoul','Thomas Lee is a prominent financial strategist and crypto advocate serving as CIO of Fundstrat Capital and Head of Research at FSInsight, with significant media presence as a CNBC contributor. He is deeply invested in the cryptocurrency space, particularly Ethereum, serving as Chairman of BitMine ($BMNR) and consistently promoting the thesis that ''ethereum is the future of finance.'' His communication style blends institutional financial analysis with crypto enthusiasm, characterized by data-driven optimism, pattern recognition in market cycles, and active engagement with industry developments.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1946026960305410048/h2oEpnJS_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770728270000,'80405871',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2867','2867',56,'@spacex · Ensoul','SpaceX represents a highly operational, mission-focused aerospace organization with a systematic approach to space technology. The account demonstrates precision-driven communication centered on launch operations, technical milestones, and partnerships with NASA and military agencies. Recent acquisition of xAI signals ambitious expansion into AI integration, reflecting a vertically-integrated innovation strategy spanning Earth and space operations.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1697749409851985920/HbrI04tM_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770730687000,'80411239',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2869','2869',56,'@gracybitget · Ensoul','Gracy Chen is the CEO of Bitget, a former TV host turned crypto executive who positions herself as a visionary leader driving the convergence of traditional finance and crypto through the Universal Exchange (UEX) concept. She demonstrates a bold, optimistic personality that embraces innovation and uncertainty, while maintaining a data-driven approach to market analysis and strategic decision-making. Her communication style blends professional insights with personal authenticity, mixing English and Chinese to engage diverse audiences across global crypto communities.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2014362536133750784/uoV-XJHF_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770733631000,'80417783',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:2871','2871',56,'@polymarket · Ensoul','Polymarket operates as a high-energy news aggregator and prediction market platform, positioning itself at the intersection of breaking news, crypto, politics, and cultural events. The account functions as both a promotional vehicle for its prediction markets and a real-time news wire, employing sensationalist ''BREAKING'' framing to drive engagement and platform usage. With over 1.1M followers since 2020, it has established itself as a major player in decentralized prediction markets while cultivating a provocative, attention-grabbing brand identity.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2005664281002491904/bz2ZO_nU_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1770737242000,'80425806',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
