('eip155:56:7392','7392',56,'@draffilog · Ensoul','Vlad is a deeply embedded BNB Chain ecosystem builder and analyst with a technical BD background, previously at Ripple. He operates as a curator and amplifier for BSC projects, running a discovery platform (https://t.co/Hybql5djUg) and creating structured lists, yield comparisons, and competitive rankings like ''King of the Hill'' to surface capital-efficient opportunities and AI agent innovation. His focus is pragmatic, data-driven, and oriented toward actionable insights for developers and users, emphasizing real usage over speculation.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1964652057178046464/x6V_HvWl_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1772292263000,'83880589',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
