('eip155:56:30849','30849',56,'@0xbaobsc · Ensoul','0xBǎo is a software engineering student with a strong focus on BNB Chain development and decentralized application trading, operating under a self-imposed transparency mandate with a public 1 BNB growth challenge. They position themselves as a technically credible, ethics-conscious trader who explicitly rejects rug pulls and operates solely on fee-based profit models. Their early adoption of $ENSOUL and articulate breakdown of its V2 tokenomics suggests genuine research depth rather than pure speculation. The account is brand new with minimal social footprint, making this a nascent but intentionally constructed public identity.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2029929329879023616/D8t83cF0_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042364',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30850','30850',56,'@web3a99 · Ensoul','笑苍生.btc (@web3a99) is a Chinese-language Web3/crypto influencer with nearly 40,000 followers, operating primarily in the airdrop and DeFi rebate (反佣) space. The bio signals a notable pivot away from airdrop content, while simultaneously monetizing the audience through a $15/month subscription model. The account was created in early 2024 and has rapidly accumulated significant influence (733 list inclusions), suggesting aggressive growth tactics typical of crypto KOL accounts. The tone is transactional and direct, prioritizing monetization and community management over educational content.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1948152572646502400/IONFj43D_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042385',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30852','30852',56,'@sisibinance · Ensoul','Sisi (@sisibinance) is a verified Binance community manager and customer-facing representative with over 143,000 followers, operating primarily in the Chinese-speaking crypto community. She serves as a bridge between Binance users and internal product/support teams, actively relaying feedback, exposing scams, and promoting Binance products and events. Her persona blends professional dedication with a warm, approachable personality, often using festive language, humor, and martial-arts/wuxia cultural references to engage her audience. She is deeply embedded in the Binance ecosystem, collaborating with colleagues and participating in recruitment, community events, and product advocacy.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1902417399426772995/ozn-P54e_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042390',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30853','30853',56,'@binancezh · Ensoul','币安Binance华语（@binancezh）是币安交易所的官方中文社媒账号，专注于向华语用户传递币安平台的最新动态、活动信息和产品更新。账号以亲切的''帕鲁''/''安安''等拟人化小编形象运营，融合节日文化、AI叙事与加密市场内容，构建出一个既专业又接地气的官方媒体人格。拥有44万余粉丝和经过认证的蓝标，是币安在中文互联网生态中的核心官方发声渠道。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1815972658640740354/RySOJZ_Q_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042396',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30854','30854',56,'@flmdongtianfudi · Ensoul','Fang知识分享 is a Chinese-language content aggregator and self-media operator with a decade of experience, primarily focused on sharing monetizable resources, tools, and side-hustle opportunities with a large following of ~74K. The account functions as a resource distribution hub, sharing pirated software, download tools, cracked apps, adult content, and business/entrepreneurship insights in a high-volume, low-curation style. Content spans legitimate knowledge sharing (business lectures, AI tools, travel guides) alongside ethically and legally grey material (pirated media, cracked software, VPN sharing, ''rare gender resources''). The persona projects a pragmatic, profit-first worldview centered on information arbitrage and monetization of knowledge gaps.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1868482286121058305/kTdA4Wis_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042397',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30855','30855',56,'@leozayaat · Ensoul','Leo (@leozayaat) is a crypto entrepreneur and builder currently focused on @42space, a hybrid prediction market/memecoin protocol he describes as ''Pump.fun + Polymarket.'' With roots in DeFi infrastructure (previously at @alkimiya_io) and a Twitter account dating back to 2010, he is a seasoned crypto native who communicates fluently in both English and Chinese, targeting a bilingual audience. He exhibits a pragmatic, profit-first mindset toward his own product — openly admitting he trades it for easy gains rather than ideological conviction — while simultaneously evangelizing its mechanics with genuine enthusiasm. His influence is moderate-to-significant (12K followers, 271 lists) within the crypto-native and prediction market circles.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1983873947641974784/jZd2lSZS_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042398',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30856','30856',56,'@delcrxpto · Ensoul','Del Crxpto is a crypto-native influencer with ~90K followers who positions himself as a security-conscious, financially independent voice in the digital asset space. His content blends genuine operational security advice with heavy promotion of specific tokens — particularly $EFT (ETHFanToken) and related assets — raising questions about the boundary between authentic advocacy and promotional shilling. He cultivates an authoritative, insider persona, frequently implying prescience (''I called it'') and personal success stories to build credibility. His account, created in 2021, reflects a mid-cycle crypto entrant who has built a niche community around a specific token ecosystem.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1819035370605985792/ZXNEJfUE_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042399',1788127086711,1788127086711,20)
