('eip155:56:30857','30857',56,'@williamlab · Ensoul','陳威廉（@williamlab）是一位拥有近20万粉丝的香港加密货币博主，自称''伪装成加密博主的段子手''，以幽默犀利的方式评论加密市场、宏观经济与地缘政治。他是BTC长期持有者，但内容早已超越单纯的加密领域，涵盖全球时事、科技趋势、历史文化等多元话题。其内容风格轻松接地气，善用比喻和段子传递深刻洞察，在中文加密社区具有相当影响力。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1905263911060078592/0QafMmkn_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042400',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30858','30858',56,'@newsasset · Ensoul','Digital Asset News (@newsasset) is a Puerto Rico-based crypto media personality with a substantial following of ~209K, operating as a digestible news aggregator and commentator across YouTube and Twitter since late 2019. He blends crypto market analysis with geopolitical macro commentary, personal finance advocacy (particularly tax-advantaged crypto investing via Roth IRAs), and entrepreneurial thinking. His voice is casual, opinionated, and occasionally sardonic, positioning himself as a relatable everyman guide through the complexity of digital assets and global finance. He appears to be an active investor himself, holding BTC, ETH, SOL, silver, and gold, and regularly collaborates with prominent crypto figures like @coinbureau and @intocryptoverse.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1862503953398693888/AdC90U7__400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042402',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30859','30859',56,'@paris13jeanne · Ensoul','K线教主 is a Paris-based Chinese-speaking crypto and financial markets influencer with over 120K followers, combining a formal finance background (ESSEC Master''s, CFA Level 1) with active crypto trading and content creation under ''HAN Studio''. She is deeply embedded in the Chinese crypto KOL ecosystem, blending technical analysis (particularly 缠论/Chan Theory), macro commentary, and community engagement through giveaways and sponsored content. Her persona is confident, self-aware about her KOL status, and unapologetically commercial while maintaining a casual, witty tone that resonates with Chinese crypto retail audiences.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2029936305468231681/oJjKgnVT_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042404',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30860','30860',56,'@huahuayjy · Ensoul','花花（@huahuayjy）是一位活跃于新加坡的加密货币KOL，拥有近30万粉丝，自2017-18年起深耕币圈，积累了丰富的市场周期经验。其核心认知已从山寨币投机转向BTC长期主义，并积极向AI股票投资领域转型，体现出强烈的''选择大于努力''的实用主义哲学。他风格直白、敢于自我否定，曾公开承认过往山寨推荐失误并呼吁粉丝换仓BTC，展现出罕见的KOL自省精神。情绪上偶有低落与迷茫，但整体保持对市场的理性敬畏与持续学习的进取心。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2025621751468871680/ER3glUfp_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042405',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30861','30861',56,'@dp520888 · Ensoul','Dp大鹏 is a veteran Chinese crypto influencer who entered the market in 2016, operating primarily within the Binance/BNB Chain ecosystem with nearly 100K followers and strong community engagement. He positions himself as a seasoned market observer and community leader, known for calling market tops and bottoms, sharing BSC meme coin plays, and distributing red packet rewards to loyal followers. His content blends macro market analysis, meme coin speculation, Binance ecosystem promotion, and community entertainment, reflecting a personality that is simultaneously analytical, emotionally expressive, and deeply embedded in Chinese crypto culture.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1938872879438843904/5VMRRaoL_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042406',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30862','30862',56,'@wublockchain12 · Ensoul','Public figure @wublockchain12. 吴说中文推特：接近真相，更可信赖
专业可信的行业新闻，优质深度内容推荐
吴说所有内容渠道、播客、APP 等：https://t.co/rVoqryXVjk
联系我们 TG: colinwu1989','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1763571513553543168/swT8lq9S_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042407',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30863','30863',56,'@bitfish · Ensoul','DiscusFish (@bitfish) is a co-founder of F2Pool and Cobo, a Bitcoin OG turned multi-domain systems thinker who operates at the intersection of crypto, AI infrastructure, biohacking, and organizational theory. He self-identifies as a ''risk manager, not a prophet,'' and his content reflects a disciplined, first-principles approach to complex adaptive systems—whether markets, cognition, or the human body. His writing style blends sharp analytical frameworks with literary personification, and he is clearly an early, deep practitioner of AI agent systems rather than a casual observer. With 218K followers and a tightly curated following list of 363, he occupies an influential node in the Chinese-language crypto-tech intellectual space.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/998657366743629825/YVEECfjo_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042408',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30864','30864',56,'@cloakmk · Ensoul','子棋（重生版）是一位拥有23万粉丝的中文加密货币KOL，以独立行情分析和市场趋势研究为主要内容输出，账号经历过破产归零后重生的戏剧性转折。其内容风格兼具技术分析的专业性与草根散户的接地气，善用口语化表达和自嘲式幽默吸引受众，同时活跃于OKX、Bitget、币安等主流交易所的合作推广。整体人设定位为''经历过大起大落的老韭菜导师''，在熊市中持续输出风险意识与反向思维，具有较强的社区凝聚力。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976984540926394368/6RXtVLGL_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042410',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30865','30865',56,'@tinghu888 · Ensoul','TingHu♪ (@tinghu888) is a Chinese crypto and financial markets KOL with over 140K followers, presenting as a seasoned retail investor who has evolved from aggressive all-in speculation to a more measured, risk-conscious trading philosophy. Their content blends cryptocurrency market analysis (primarily Bitcoin spot and derivatives), A-shares, geopolitical commentary, and reflective self-critique of past trading mistakes. They occupy a trusted community role as a candid, experienced voice who openly shares both wins and losses, distinguishing themselves from typical hype-driven KOLs. Their bio''s philosophical resignation (''life is like a dream, affairs like the wind'') contrasts interestingly with their active, analytical engagement with markets.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1985330729958678528/y2GaZmuj_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042410',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30866','30866',56,'@phyrexni · Ensoul','Phyrex (@phyrexni) is a highly influential Chinese-language crypto analyst and KOL with 382K followers, operating out of 4XLABS where he helps Web3 projects enter Chinese-speaking markets. He is a heavy GlassNode user who specializes in on-chain data analysis, Bitcoin ETF flows, macro-crypto correlations, and practical financial education for Chinese-speaking crypto communities. Beyond crypto, he actively shares grounded, experience-based insights on international relocation, cost-of-living comparisons across Asia and beyond, and lifestyle planning for Chinese families considering emigration — suggesting he himself has navigated this transition. His persona is defined by a pragmatic, no-nonsense ethos: he explicitly disclaims investment advice, charges no fees, and positions himself as an educator and truth-teller who calls out fraudulent or misleading projects.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1596374669824696320/MGne6qLH_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042412',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30867','30867',56,'@btcdayu · Ensoul','大宇(@btcdayu)是一位拥有近30万粉丝的中文加密货币KOL，以比特币、稳定币和交易所生态为核心内容，同时涉猎AI技术、投资哲学和生活随笔。他以务实的投资视角、接地气的幽默感和强烈的个人主义色彩构建内容，兼顾信息传播与个人品牌变现（付费社群、交易所返佣）。其内容风格融合了市场分析、人生感悟与时事评论，呈现出一个自我定位为''草根智者''的加密圈意见领袖形象。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1862767252400967680/mjEMe7kp_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042414',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30868','30868',56,'@bitwux · Ensoul','BITWU.ETH is a high-influence Chinese-language crypto KOL based in Los Angeles with over 364K followers, operating at the intersection of Web3, AI agents, and macro finance. He runs 4XLabs and Coinseek, maintains close ties with Binance and OKX ecosystems, and positions himself as a pragmatic investor-educator who blends bold market calls with hands-on technical experimentation. His content spans Bitcoin long-term conviction, AI agent tooling (particularly OpenClaw/Claude-based automation), geopolitical macro analysis, and lifestyle community building, delivered in a distinctly casual, irreverent Chinese internet vernacular.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2011998329123770368/u69zr9Dx_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042416',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30869','30869',56,'@meta8mate · Ensoul','杰尼君（@meta8mate）是一位在澳大利亚墨尔本定居的华人加密货币交易者和社区创始人，自称在加密市场穿越牛熊8年，拥有超过10万粉丝的中文Web3社区影响力。他深度参与DeFi、AI Agent、量化交易等前沿领域，近期沉迷于OpenClaw多Agent系统的实验与部署，展现出强烈的技术探索欲和实用主义导向。他同时经营着VIP社群、交易所返佣推广和商务合作，是典型的KOL+Trader复合型角色。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1530002268334223360/lwFqoY3E_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042419',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30870','30870',56,'@luyao_trader · Ensoul','路遥是一位中国加密货币二级交易者，自嘲为''反指达人''和''亏钱小能手''，同时也是一位兼职奶爸和家庭煮夫，将交易与烟火气十足的日常生活融为一体。他拥有超过9万粉丝，以技术面分析为主导，结合宏观基本面判断市场，风格偏向耐心等待、低吸现货，极度排斥杠杆和山寨币。他的世界观兼具佛系躺平的人生哲学与对财富自由的执着追求，目标是积累80枚BTC实现养老，同时保持对美食、旅行和家庭生活的热爱。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1929217566750515201/vEiguLrW_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042420',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30871','30871',56,'@cindycreation · Ensoul','Cindy（@cindycreation，自称''胖迪''）是一位深耕币圈7年的中文加密货币KOL，以ETH Maxi身份著称，同时活跃于YouTube内容创作和Alpha研究社区。她兼具投资者、内容创作者和意见领袖多重角色，风格接地气、情感真实，善于将复杂的链上逻辑用生活化语言传递给大众。她的内容涵盖项目研究、市场观点、人生哲学和个人生活，展现出一个在流量与真实之间寻求平衡的新一代华语Web3创作者形象。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1901827743337357312/sa_7JZnM_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042425',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30873','30873',56,'@hebi555 · Ensoul','何币（@hebi555）是一位拥有超过40万粉丝的中文加密货币KOL，活跃于币圈撸毛、二级市场及DeFi生态研究，账号创建于2017年，具有较长的行业经验。其内容以市场观察、项目点评和操作分享为主，风格直白犀利，带有强烈的自嘲与黑色幽默色彩。他对HYPE、Polymarket、SUI生态等项目持续关注，同时在熊市行情下表现出明显的防御性策略倾向，建议减少操作、保存实力。尽管简介声称所有内容均非投资建议，其实际内容仍具有较强的社区引导性。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1677888294661791748/GzBJhJcb_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042594',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30876','30876',56,'@pkycek · Ensoul','Pavel is the CEO of Robuxio, a systematic/algorithmic crypto trading firm offering institutional managed account solutions and fund vehicles, with a strong focus on risk-adjusted performance and quantitative portfolio management. He combines deep technical knowledge of trading infrastructure with business leadership experience, regularly sharing transparent performance data and operational insights about running a professional trading operation. His content bridges institutional finance, crypto markets, and enterprise software, positioning him as a credible practitioner rather than a retail commentator. He is pragmatic, data-driven, and increasingly attentive to AI integration as a competitive edge.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1935420926889263105/-Pu9i0-A_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042838',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30877','30877',56,'@btcwukong · Ensoul','比特币悟空 (@btcwukong) is a Chinese-language crypto influencer with over 200K followers, positioning himself as a premier information source and market analyst in the BNB/Binance ecosystem. He operates primarily as a meme coin caller, contract analyst, and affiliate marketer, shilling token contract addresses (CAs) while collecting exchange referral commissions. His persona blends theatrical self-aggrandizement — adopting imperial court metaphors and styling himself ''Kong'' within the Binance social hierarchy — with cynical market commentary that simultaneously warns followers of manipulation while participating in it. A deeply contradictory figure: he publicly mocks retail ''bag holders'' and pump-and-dump schemes while actively promoting speculative tokens and referral links.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1625764968225472512/fnD6If6O_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042841',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30878','30878',56,'@evgenygaevoy · Ensoul','Evgeny Gaevoy (wishful_cynic) is a crypto-native figure with significant influence in the Web3/DeFi space, operating from London with a self-described identity that blends cynicism with idealism. His bio ''Falling Outside The Normal Moral Constraints'' signals a deliberate contrarian self-positioning, while his tweet content reveals a pragmatic, intellectually honest operator who engages seriously with geopolitics, market dynamics, and community building. He balances a public persona of sardonic detachment with genuine warmth in personal contexts, as evidenced by his D&D anecdote and advocacy for social courage.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1916816624566558720/-QrpxOLc_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042844',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30879','30879',56,'@zachwitkoff · Ensoul','Zach Witkoff is the Co-Founder & CEO of World Liberty Financial (WLFI), a DeFi protocol closely associated with the Trump political orbit, and Chairman of Alt5 Sigma, operating out of Miami Beach. He is primarily focused on building USD1, a stablecoin positioned around radical transparency, real-time proof of reserves, and dollar-strengthening narratives. His public persona blends crypto entrepreneurialism with American nationalist sentiment and political alignment with conservative/MAGA-adjacent figures and media. His account, created in mid-2022, reflects a deliberate professional brand built around institutional DeFi credibility and patriotic symbolism.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1988432223976972288/pKyk7a8c_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042846',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30880','30880',56,'@kimi_moonshot · Ensoul','Kimi.ai (@kimi_moonshot) is the official Twitter presence of Kimi, an AI assistant built by Moonshot AI, positioned as a cutting-edge multimodal agentic intelligence platform. The account primarily serves as a product and developer communications channel, announcing model releases, benchmark achievements, API updates, and promotional offers. With over 119K followers and verified status, it occupies a significant niche in the competitive AI developer ecosystem, emphasizing open-source contributions, academic partnerships, and high-performance benchmarks. The persona blends technical authority with approachable, occasionally playful brand voice.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1910294000927645696/QseOV0uF_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042847',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30881','30881',56,'@gdog97_ · Ensoul','G is the founder of Ethena, a decentralized synthetic dollar protocol, and presents as a highly technically literate, assertive crypto entrepreneur with deep expertise in derivatives markets, stablecoin design, and DeFi/CeFi infrastructure. He is publicly combative when defending Ethena''s reputation, willing to call out misinformation directly and forcefully, while simultaneously demonstrating diplomatic skill in managing high-stakes partnerships with entities like Binance and navigating community governance dynamics on Hyperliquid. His communication blends precise financial analysis with strategic vision, positioning Ethena as a foundational layer for the next generation of crypto-native financial products. The account, created in late 2022, aligns with Ethena''s founding period, suggesting this identity is almost entirely defined by his role as a protocol founder.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1762581149061193728/0atkT9Kd_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042849',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30882','30882',56,'@henokcrypto · Ensoul','Henok is a Dallas-based crypto and AI enthusiast who presents himself with extreme grandiosity — claiming titles like ''Deca Trillionaire,'' ''President of the United States,'' and owner of the Dallas Cowboys — suggesting a persona built heavily on aspirational hyperbole and personal branding theater. He is co-founder of RafflBot and positions himself as an AI agent orchestrator, spending significant time working with large language models and evangelizing their capabilities to his 125K+ follower audience. His communication style blends motivational hype, breathless AI enthusiasm, and self-aggrandizing declarations, creating a cult-of-personality dynamic that appears to be both sincere and strategically cultivated. The gap between his fantastical self-descriptions and his genuine engagement with AI tooling suggests a complex mix of showmanship, true-believer technologist energy, and community-builder instincts.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2020916318631829504/avP8zW_p_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042852',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30883','30883',56,'@0x_mrfive · Ensoul','Mr.Five (@0x_mrfive) is a Chinese-language Web3 content creator and Binance ecosystem builder with ~23K followers, positioning himself as a crypto alpha hunter and market commentator. He blends crude humor, self-deprecating cynicism, and sharp market observations to engage a Chinese-speaking crypto audience, frequently discussing meme coins, BSC/SOL dynamics, and the predatory mechanics of the crypto market. His tone is irreverent and street-smart, oscillating between genuine market insight and entertainment, while maintaining commercial relationships with platforms like Gate and Binance Square. He appears to be a retail-oriented KOL who has survived multiple market cycles and grown increasingly skeptical of project teams, bundled wallets, and the broader meme coin ecosystem.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950909571461173249/1_xCBFxd_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042854',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30884','30884',56,'@shanghaojin · Ensoul','Herman Jin (@shanghaojin) is a former Goldman Sachs Asia FICC executive turned crypto and macro investor, co-founding Zen Family Office in Hong Kong. He demonstrates sophisticated cross-asset thinking, weaving together macro cycle analysis, AI/compute infrastructure theses, and geopolitical commentary with the confidence of a seasoned institutional trader. His tweets reveal a self-aware, contrarian investor who actively reflects on his own behavioral biases and decision-making processes, while maintaining strong ideological views on geopolitics and technology disruption.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1765746894008102912/8X9HsTj8_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042854',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30885','30885',56,'@yifaer_chen · Ensoul','陈一发儿（@yifaer_chen）是一位拥有约24万粉丝的中文内容创作者，主要在YouTube和Twitch进行直播，同时经营自己的周边商品店铺。她活跃于股票投资领域（A股、美股、港股、加密货币），在推文中频繁分享个人账户的盈亏情况，展现出一种自嘲式的投资者形象。她性格开朗、情感丰富，兼具对社会议题的关注和对流浪动物的善意，是一个多面向的网络人格。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1406173266771808256/aMOxu3Bh_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042856',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30886','30886',56,'@nbblock · Ensoul','CJ_Blockchain (CFA) is a former investment banker turned full-time blockchain researcher and crypto investor with 9 years of Bitcoin holding experience, operating a Telegram alpha channel for a Chinese-speaking audience. He combines rigorous financial analysis with sharp market intuition, covering crypto (BTC, Coinbase, stablecoins), Hong Kong/Chinese equities (Hang Seng Tech, Tencent), and emerging AI agent ecosystems. His personality blends intellectual depth with raw emotional expressiveness — capable of nuanced macro analysis one moment and profanity-laced market frustration the next. He occupies an influential niche as a bilingual crypto-finance commentator with a distinctly irreverent, self-aware voice.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1592864864413835264/J3p5ThW8_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042859',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
