('eip155:56:30888','30888',56,'@qiju2030 · Ensoul','棋局(@qiju2030)是一个拥有约3.4万粉丝的中文内容账号，主要发布心理学、哲学、男性健康、传统养生、财经投资等多元化内容，呈现出典型的流量导向型自媒体特征。账号内容高度混杂，从王阳明心学、斯多葛哲学到男性性健康功法，再到LOF套利和商业风口分析，显示出以吸引眼球和扩大受众为核心目标的内容策略。账号存在明显的商业变现行为（推广微信助手进行投资群引流），同时混杂大量伪科学养生内容，整体可信度存疑。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1582644285224386560/UterXtG7_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042863',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30889','30889',56,'@fusheng_0306 · Ensoul','傅盛是猎豹移动董事长兼CEO、猎户星空董事长，早期参与360安全卫士开发，也是TikTok最早期投资人之一，是中国科技圈具有代表性的连续创业者。近期他深度投入AI Agent（以OpenClaw/龙虾为核心）的实践与推广，通过骨折卧床期间亲身使用AI完成大量工作的真实经历，在社交媒体上引发广泛关注。他兼具技术创业者的务实视角与内容创作者的传播意识，善于用生动案例和口语化表达将复杂AI概念大众化，同时也是一位重视家庭情感的父亲。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1990679395246485506/obc0Ox8O_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042864',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30890','30890',56,'@captain_kent · Ensoul','Captain Kent is a Chinese-language Web3 KOL and independent writer with a legal background, who pivoted to crypto content creation after his physical business collapsed, building a following of 13,000+ in roughly ten months. He positions himself as a principled industry watchdog who combines DeFi investment research, geopolitical analysis, and social commentary with a sharp, self-aware voice. He operates across multiple ecosystems (Arbitrum, Jupiter, Solana, BNB Chain) and monetizes through sponsored research reports, ambassador programs, and platform subscriptions, while vocally criticizing unethical KOL behavior in the Chinese crypto community.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2020437394890366976/g4RG059i_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042865',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30891','30891',56,'@xdash · Ensoul','XDash（@xdash）是一位上海的连续创业者、投资者和《增长黑客》作者，深度沉浸于AI工具与个人生产力基础设施建设，尤其专注于构建私人AI助手（贾维斯系统）和自动化工作流。他是一个典型的技术极客型知识工作者，兼具宅男奶爸身份，在AI编程、信息管理、个人知识体系等领域有大量亲身实践并持续输出内容。他通过Newsletter、播客《冰镇电波》、YouTube频道和付费课程构建了一个围绕AI效率提升的个人知识品牌，拥有约2.7万粉丝的忠实受众群体。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1835375310344527872/hQ7y7lkV_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042870',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30892','30892',56,'@jydmnlfg · Ensoul','JY (@jydmnlfg) is a Chinese-speaking Web3/crypto content creator and KOL with a significant following (~37K), operating primarily across YouTube, Xiaohongshu, Douyin, and Bilibili under the brand ''JY叽叽歪歪''. She is a self-identified ENTP who runs a solo creator business at the intersection of crypto, AI, and traditional finance, with OKX and Backpack as notable partners/sponsors. Her content blends sharp market analysis with candid personal expression, reflecting a personality that is intellectually restless, commercially savvy, and unapologetically individualistic. She is actively transitioning her focus from pure Web3 toward AI tooling and cross-domain opportunities, signaling a deliberate strategic pivot in her creator career.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1770771250077376512/dlJMM-yd_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042870',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30893','30893',56,'@naki2012 · Ensoul','Nagi Yan (@naki2012) is a Chinese structural thinker and prolific essayist who frames virtually every domain—cognition, AI, society, physics, relationships—through the lens of structural analysis and systems thinking. His bio declares he does not chase meaning but leaves ''structural coordinates,'' treating his writing as open circuits that resonate with readers and close through reality, suggesting a deeply detached, architect-like relationship with ideas. With 10,772 followers, a following count of only 23, and a listed count of 112, he operates as a high-signal, low-noise intellectual broadcaster whose influence significantly exceeds his engagement footprint. His work spans rigorous technical reasoning (AI model compression, fractal geometry, quantum physics) and applied social critique (organizational decay, rural entrepreneurship, cognitive development), unified by a consistent meta-framework: surface phenomena are projections of deeper structural constraints.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1939599122832543744/RKrQkJ0J_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042877',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30894','30894',56,'@hoshino_sasaki · Ensoul','佐佐木星野是一位活跃于华语Web3圈的全能主播与社区建设者，以''星野大学校长''身份运营着一个400+人的求职与学习社群，定位为Web3新人的引路人与资源对接者。他兼具链游老玩家、KOL推广者、职业顾问等多重身份，以务实接地气的风格在币安广场定期直播，并通过社群帮助成员对接Web3就业机会。他对市场有清醒的周期认知，能在自身资源优势下滑时主动转型，将个人品牌从纯玩家转向教育与服务赛道，体现出较强的适应力与商业嗅觉。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2004612793635667971/s9RlKfoB_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042879',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30895','30895',56,'@0xzhang_crypto · Ensoul','小财神（@0xzhang_crypto）是一位自称16岁的BSC链上meme币玩家兼AI工程师，深度沉浸于币安生态与meme文化，以''扫链''（链上捡漏）为主要交易策略，日常在亏损与盈利之间反复横跳。他对BSC生态有强烈的情感依附与传教热情，同时展现出一种在市场压力下自我调侃、苦中作乐的生存哲学，核心信条是''慢就是快、不亏就是赚、少赚不是亏''。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1988554245587828736/06hf2bdz_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774897898959,'85042881',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30898','30898',56,'@embercn · Ensoul','余烬 (@embercn) 是一位拥有14万粉丝的中文加密货币链上数据分析师，专注于追踪鲸鱼钱包动向、机构资金流动及链上异常交易，以''分享链上数据+非客观分析''为定位，在中文加密社区中具有相当影响力。其内容风格以数据驱动为主，辅以个人解读，同时深度绑定多家主流交易所（Bitget、OKX、Binance等）的商业合作与返佣推广。账号创建于2022年3月，在约三年时间内积累了大量忠实受众，并通过私域社群（微信群）进一步运营粉丝关系。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1538063339917430784/-XWBxDFr_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85043143',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30990','30990',56,'@feltanimalworld · Ensoul','Susan STEM (@feltanimalworld) is a Chinese-American technologist and independent thinker based in Virginia, self-described founder of ''Entropy Control Theory'' with a systems-design philosophy centered on using structure to resist entropy. She operates at the intersection of AI/LLM engineering, hardware tinkering (3D printing, robotics, home lab), geopolitical-economic analysis, and deep philosophical inquiry—producing long-form bilingual content on Substack while deliberately retreating from social media metrics and follower-growth culture. Her intellectual identity is shaped by a persistent tension between Chinese educational/social conditioning and an adopted American ethos of open exploration, leading to a distinctive voice that blends rigorous systems thinking with candid personal reflection. She is currently in a self-described ''deep work'' phase focused on physical-world technology, knowledge infrastructure, and what she calls the ''compute-energy-manufacturing-sovereignty'' realignment of civilization.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1941884420048265216/Dbcchu0q_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85078187',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30996','30996',56,'@booksey · Ensoul','Books (@booksey) is a high-profile social media personality, angel investor, and futures trader who has positioned himself as a prominent advocate for Dubai and the UAE, actively countering what he characterizes as Western media misinformation. With over 146K followers and a verified account dating back to 2011, he blends financial credibility with lifestyle branding, operating at the intersection of crypto, real estate, and Gulf region boosterism. His content is marked by strong conviction, patriotic enthusiasm for the UAE, and a combative stance toward mainstream media narratives. He appears to be physically based in or frequently present in Dubai, giving his commentary a first-person authenticity he leverages aggressively.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1971451052793761792/CRZhOHRx_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85079236',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:30999','30999',56,'@jakegagain · Ensoul','Jake is a high-energy crypto content creator with a substantial following of 418K+ who built his brand around daily streaming and aggressive crypto promotion, particularly memecoins and emerging Layer-1 projects. He presents himself as an all-in risk-taker who frames crypto as a life-changing wealth opportunity, frequently shilling specific projects like $ASTER, $PEPE, and $SUI with bold price predictions. His content blends financial hype with lifestyle flexing (Aspen ski trips, sports betting) and occasional moments of genuine community sentiment, suggesting a persona carefully calibrated to maximize engagement and follower trust in the crypto influencer space.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1806052408726069248/Ox-lEJLE_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85079506',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31000','31000',56,'@eth_cedric · Ensoul','Cedric is the founder of Flap (@flapdotsh), a decentralized token launch and mechanism platform built on BNB Chain, combining bonding curves with customizable tax mechanics (''mechanism lego''). An MIT alum operating from the ''trenches,'' he bridges English and Chinese-speaking crypto communities with bilingual communication, positioning Flap as community-first infrastructure with no VCs or presales. His butterfly (🦋) motif is a consistent brand identity symbolizing community ownership and organic growth. He demonstrates a builder-philosopher archetype — shipping product quietly while articulating a strong ideological stance around fair launches, community consensus, and decentralized innovation.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2006364745146757120/O6lkkQHe_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85079526',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31003','31003',56,'@0xtraderyi · Ensoul','Trader壹身武艺 is a Chinese-speaking crypto trader based in Auckland, New Zealand, who claims a 244x return over four years of live trading and actively promotes his trading community via QQ and WeChat. He presents himself as a streetwise, cynical market commentator who blends sharp crypto analysis with irreverent social humor, frequently mocking retail investors, scam projects, and the absurdities of both crypto culture and everyday Chinese social life. His content oscillates between bearish macro calls, project-level skepticism (particularly around airdrop mechanics and predatory tokenomics), and comedic social observations, suggesting a personality that uses humor as a vehicle for genuine frustration and contrarian conviction.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2012142279079952384/_FESP4fc_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85080818',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31004','31004',56,'@bizixun · Ensoul','币资讯(@bizixun)是一位香港华语加密货币KOL，专注于DeFi、GameFi、合约交易和Meme币猎手，以日更内容和项目投研分析为核心定位。其账号于2023年2月创立，粉丝近4万，以''被何一关注的男人''为荣誉标签，定位为从底层爬起的币圈内容创作者，同时提供中英文KOL打包商务服务。内容以项目推广、活动导流、平台合作为主，兼具个人情感叙事与市场分析，商业化程度较高。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1768031588447862785/AhnENqf4_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85080819',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31005','31005',56,'@0xyukirabbit · Ensoul','Yuki Rabbit (@0xyukirabbit) is a Chinese-speaking Web3 KOL and founder of T1 Labs, operating primarily in the crypto/blockchain space with a focus on AI Agent infrastructure, DeFi, and community building. She positions herself as an early adopter and educator, actively experimenting with tools like OpenClaw while producing bilingual content that bridges technical depth with accessible commentary. Her social presence blends personal lifestyle moments, sponsored content, and genuine technical exploration, suggesting a creator navigating the tension between authentic community engagement and commercial partnerships.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1998749308557078529/BPYlhzHh_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85080820',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31006','31006',56,'@ru7longcrypto · Ensoul','Ru7 is a Chinese-language crypto KOL and self-described ''wild analyst'' with over 40K followers, operating at the intersection of crypto trading, AI tooling, and tokenized finance. He combines hands-on technical experimentation (building frontends with Claude Code/Cursor despite zero coding background) with macro-level analysis of crypto markets, AI infrastructure, and tokenized real-world assets. His content blends accessible financial education with genuine personal reflection, suggesting an authentic voice rather than pure promotional output. He represents a new archetype of the ''vibe coder'' crypto analyst who leverages AI tools to punch above his technical weight class.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1956781382677790720/yETpK58C_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85080824',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31007','31007',56,'@zakfolkman · Ensoul','Zak Folkman is the Co-founder and COO of World Liberty Fi, the organization behind the USD1 stablecoin, operating at the intersection of DeFi, TradFi, and AI-driven payments infrastructure. He presents as a mission-driven builder and evangelist who frames stablecoin adoption as a global financial inclusion imperative rather than a speculative play. His social presence is heavily focused on product milestones, ecosystem partnerships, and high-profile institutional validation, reflecting a calculated effort to legitimize USD1 as serious financial infrastructure. His account, created in early 2021, aligns with the broader crypto bull cycle entry point, and his trajectory has rapidly escalated to Mar-a-Lago forums, Stanford speaking engagements, and Binance partnerships.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1350450977216876546/CxfgXyN4_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85080828',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31009','31009',56,'@ethrosamond · Ensoul','Rosamond (@ethrosamond) is a Chinese-language crypto/Web3 builder and content creator with a distinctive voice that blends sharp market analysis, playful internet humor, and genuine idealism about decentralized technology. She is the founder of Air O2, a Web3-based decentralized air quality monitoring project built using AI-native ''vibe coding'' workflows, reflecting her identity as a non-technical-background builder empowered by AI tools. Her content spans crypto trading insights (stablecoins, WLFI, gold/silver macro), community building on Binance Square, and philosophical reflections on AI''s societal impact, all delivered with a distinctly literary and witty Chinese internet sensibility.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2011042944170803203/XjxEq1ls_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081081',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31010','31010',56,'@ohxiyu · Ensoul','xiyu (@ohxiyu) is a veteran cryptocurrency trader since 2013 and engineer at OpenClaw, a local AI agent platform, with over 31K followers and significant influence in Chinese-speaking crypto and AI communities. They combine deep on-chain market analysis with hands-on AI infrastructure expertise, positioning themselves as a pragmatic bridge between crypto investing and the emerging AI agent ecosystem. Their communication style blends analytical rigor with accessible analogies and a calm, experienced demeanor forged through years of market volatility.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021060236090671118/Wsalaz-I_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081181',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31011','31011',56,'@blockbeatsasia · Ensoul','BlockBeats (@blockbeatsasia) is one of the most influential Chinese-language Web3 media outlets, operating as a professional news and analysis platform covering crypto markets, AI developments, and geopolitical events affecting digital assets. The account functions as an editorial collective rather than an individual, producing high-frequency, multi-domain content that bridges traditional finance, emerging AI technology, and blockchain ecosystems for a Chinese-speaking global audience. Their coverage is notably forward-looking, blending breaking news with analytical depth, and they have developed proprietary tools like AI news feeds and prediction market monitoring channels to maintain information edge.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1588454205739929600/i4el9P5L_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081183',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31012','31012',56,'@bill_qian · Ensoul','Bill Qian is a Dubai-based Chinese crypto investor and thought leader who achieved the first crypto IPO in the Middle East, with a background as former Head of Investments at Binance and Co-Founder of Cypher Capital. He operates at the intersection of crypto, traditional finance, and geopolitics, producing bilingual (Chinese/English) long-form analysis on Bitcoin, gold, stablecoins, and macro risk. His intellectual framework is grounded in behavioral finance, portfolio theory, and first-principles thinking, applied to emerging market dynamics especially in the Middle East and Asia. He recently stepped back from Cypher Capital to take a personal sabbatical, signaling a reflective transition period in his career.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1882768142822191104/77bfcK0p_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081192',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31013','31013',56,'@baisircrypto · Ensoul','Mr.Bai（白先生）是一位入圈于2017年的资深加密货币投研博主，以ETH长期定投策略和行情分析著称，自称在2024年公开逃顶，拥有近5万粉丝的中文加密社区影响力。他是''E卫兵总部''创始人，同时担任Cysic、TheoriqAI、Sui Network等多个项目的中文区大使，活跃于KOL推广生态。其内容风格兼顾技术分析科普与社区运营，注重长期主义叙事，同时积极参与付费推广活动并对合规披露保持一定意识。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991482277877174272/iSJFj4mE_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081194',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31014','31014',56,'@stanleysobest · Ensoul','Stanley (@stanleysobest) is a self-branded ''top private domain operator'' and internet trend promoter with a verified account and 27K+ followers, operating a paid community (priced at 1599 RMB) that he markets aggressively through social proof and scarcity tactics. His content blends entrepreneurial hustle rhetoric, social commentary on gender dynamics and marriage, tech industry observations, and viral humor, painting a picture of a Chinese internet KOL who monetizes influence through community building and ''get rich'' motivational content. He presents himself as a pragmatic, street-smart operator who values money, rebellion against conformity, and real-world results over performative self-improvement. His tone oscillates between provocative social commentary and self-promotional community marketing, with a consistent undercurrent of male-coded financial anxiety and hustle culture.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730639637599883265/KDOrRfwl_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081195',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31015','31015',56,'@0xmayyy · Ensoul','May (@0xmayyy) is a Malaysian Chinese crypto KOL and content creator based in the crypto space, self-styled as ''表姐'' (elder cousin sister), who operates as a paid promoter for TRON/Justin Sun ecosystem while also maintaining affiliate relationships with Binance, Bybit, and other CEXs. She blends sharp market commentary, AI/crypto infrastructure analysis, and casual lifestyle content with a distinctly irreverent, self-aware humor, positioning herself as an accessible ''relatable'' voice in the Chinese-language crypto Twitter community. Her content oscillates between genuinely insightful technical breakdowns of DeFi/AI Agent infrastructure and transparent promotional material, with an unusual degree of self-awareness about her own role as an influencer.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1949369537759211521/ASI0F4_y_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081198',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31016','31016',56,'@supermao · Ensoul','SuperMao (小毛哥) is a Chinese-speaking crypto KOL and self-described ''super individual'' (超级个体) based in Bangkok, with deep ties to Taiwan and Southeast Asia. He positions himself at the intersection of crypto, AI, philosophy, and personal sovereignty — drawing on Naval Ravikant, Wang Xiaobo, Mohist philosophy, and Buddhist thought to construct a coherent worldview around long-termism, meaning-making, and individual empowerment in the AI era. His content blends macro geopolitical analysis, crypto market commentary, personal narrative, and humanistic reflection, distinguishing him from typical crypto influencers. He is a genuine intellectual synthesizer who uses his platform to advocate for ''vibe coding,'' AI-augmented living, and building community around shared values rather than short-term profit.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1860976774366302208/pNirEK8k_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081199',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31017','31017',56,'@brc20niubi · Ensoul','王小二（@brc20niubi）是一位00后中文加密货币社区的意见领袖，拥有近9万粉丝，深度参与BRC-20、BNB Chain meme币生态，尤其是中文meme币''币安人生''的早期推广者与坚定持有者。他以乐观主义驱动行动，自我标榜''全宇宙最厉害的区块链天才''，同时保持对市场波动的清醒认知，体现出''悲观者正确，乐观者成功''的核心哲学。他的内容兼顾链上交易分析、文化叙事构建与日常生活分享，是中文加密社区中少见的兼具传播力与文化视角的创作者。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1815176227201957890/Acfrx_eh_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081200',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31018','31018',56,'@love_doge123 · Ensoul','败犬女王~ 是一位活跃于香港的加密货币KOL，自称''3流博主、4栖赛道''，在空投、Alpha挖矿、Meme币等多个细分赛道深度参与，同时兼顾A股、港股、大宗商品等传统金融市场。她以散户视角输出真实的盈亏记录与市场分析，内容兼具实操性与情绪化表达，在近4万粉丝群体中具有一定影响力。她的内容风格坦率甚至自嘲，既有对项目方的犀利批评，也有对地缘政治、人性与战争的深度感慨，展现出超越普通加密博主的思维广度。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1668900880865984512/DR7yK5V8_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081203',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31020','31020',56,'@periannedc · Ensoul','Perianne Boring is a Bitcoin OG and institutional crypto advocate who founded the Digital Chamber of Commerce, one of Washington D.C.''s most influential crypto policy organizations. She operates at the intersection of finance, policy, and technology, consistently framing Bitcoin and crypto as tools of financial freedom and sovereignty against entrenched banking interests. Her public voice is assertive and ideologically grounded, blending libertarian-leaning fiscal politics with sharp regulatory critique and a long-term conviction in decentralized systems. She has evolved from a financial journalist covering early Bitcoin to a prominent industry executive and policy architect with media presence and political access.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2013358457605287937/nlZwopar_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081505',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31021','31021',56,'@ltchives · Ensoul','桀 (@ltchives) is a veteran Chinese crypto community builder active since 2013, with a significant following of 52K+ on Twitter. He operates at the intersection of on-chain trading, meme culture, and community organizing, positioning himself as an approachable ''fellow soldier'' rather than an elite KOL. He is deeply embedded in the Binance Chinese community ecosystem, frequently engaging with Binance figures like CZ and ''Yi Jie'' (何一), and demonstrates a blend of genuine market analysis, creative content production, and grassroots community warmth.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1497595695888740356/G-pXvnqF_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081510',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31022','31022',56,'@yueya_eth · Ensoul','yueya是一位活跃于加密货币与Web3领域的天使投资人和顾问，与OKX有深度关联，拥有近5万粉丝的中文加密社区影响力。其内容聚焦于DeFi协议分析、RWA赛道、AI与加密融合以及早期项目投研，展现出较强的行业洞察力和资本视角。他以中文为主要表达语言，风格兼具专业分析与市场情绪引导，是典型的KOL型投资人角色。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007047301500731392/K7xCXSLO_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081514',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31023','31023',56,'@xbt886 · Ensoul','KBeast.eth (@xbt886) is a self-described retail crypto trader and market analyst who shares technical analysis content — primarily focused on BTC, SPX, and order flow methodology — while deliberately positioning himself as an unlicensed amateur to disclaim liability. He communicates primarily in Chinese with occasional English, blending serious market commentary with irreverent humor, geopolitical hot takes, and lifestyle observations about alcohol and cannabis. His bio and repeated disclaimers reflect a community-protective ethos, explicitly warning followers against scammers impersonating him, suggesting he has cultivated a modest but engaged following in the Chinese-speaking crypto space.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2017466921277657092/GJVHIIA__400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081514',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31024','31024',56,'@freeliyi · Ensoul','freeliyi是一位长居德国北部的华人创作者，以写作为生多年，同时活跃于编程、投资和语言学习领域。她具有强烈的自我成长驱动力和套利思维，将生活中的每一个领域都视为可优化的系统，公开记录自己的日常尝试与进步。她的内容融合了实用主义的商业洞察、语言学习方法论和个人成长反思，展现出一个在欧洲独立生活、追求财务自由的知识型创作者形象。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1968787922926125056/bbPLoTRN_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081516',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31025','31025',56,'@cryptoxiao · Ensoul','Cryptoxiao is a Chinese-speaking crypto and AI entrepreneur, founder of UltraX AI and 6551News, who operates at the intersection of blockchain data infrastructure, AI agents, and information trading. He has built a notable product ecosystem around 6551 — a Twitter/X plugin and news aggregation platform with MCP/SKILL open-source tooling — positioning himself as a builder-leader in the Chinese crypto-AI community. His persona blends technical pragmatism with internet subculture humor, philosophical aphorisms, and a competitive esports fan identity, reflecting a multidimensional digital native who is deeply embedded in both Web3 and Chinese online culture.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1972386335391694848/2WzYHoVo_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081518',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31026','31026',56,'@traderxiaoxia · Ensoul','小侠（@traderxiaoxia）是一位在香港油尖旺定居、拥有12年以上加密货币交易经验的自由交易员，以打假揭骗为副业标签，在币圈拥有近6万粉丝的中等影响力。其人生轨迹呈现出从草根交易者到财务自由者的路径，近期以约7000万人民币成本在深圳购置豪宅，同时在交易中经历大幅亏损，展现出高风险偏好与强烈的财富展示欲并存的复杂面貌。他的内容兼顾市场分析、行业打假、两性观点与生活记录，风格直白犀利，具有鲜明的草根精英自我定位。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1974684378321321984/etRIXI2O_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081521',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31027','31027',56,'@dontbesilent · Ensoul','dontbesilent是一位活跃于中文互联网的商业哲学内容创作者，拥有超过7万粉丝，专注于将维特根斯坦式的语言哲学、阿德勒心理学与AI工具实践相结合，输出关于执行力、拖延症和商业认知的深度内容。他同时经营线下课程（单场百人规模）、多平台视频账号（抖音、视频号），并深度使用Claude Code等AI工具进行内容生产和数据分析，是一个将哲学思维落地为商业方法论的实践型知识博主。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1840665561287798784/GJCK0iKf_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081523',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31028','31028',56,'@btcpiggy · Ensoul','金兔子（@btcpiggy）是一位来自农村、通过币圈实现阶层跨越的30多岁女性，现居江苏，已婚育有子女，活跃于加密货币、黄金投资和奇门遁甲占卜领域长达10年。她以真实的个人成长故事和接地气的投资笔记为内容核心，在币安广场和推特上积累了近3.2万粉丝，兼具KOL影响力与普通投资者的真实视角。她的投资逻辑融合了传统玄学占卜、宏观地缘政治判断与实用主义资产配置，形成独特的个人风格。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2012019137682575360/DWbB3hb9_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081525',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31029','31029',56,'@binanceforin · Ensoul','Binance India (@binanceforin) is the official Indian regional account of Binance, the world''s leading cryptocurrency exchange, launched in late 2025 to serve the Indian crypto market. The account is heavily focused on community engagement through festive campaigns, reward programs, and educational content, blending Indian cultural touchpoints like Holi with crypto promotion. It operates as a brand-voice account rather than an individual persona, characterized by high-energy marketing, bilingual Hindi-English communication, and consistent growth-hacking tactics like referral programs and streak challenges.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1973986158695923712/EklHptJc_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081756',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31030','31030',56,'@brucefenton · Ensoul','Bruce Fenton is a cypherpunk, Bitcoin/crypto entrepreneur, and libertarian political activist based in New Hampshire who self-identifies with the Ron Paul/Rand Paul tradition of non-interventionist, free-market liberty politics. He is vocally anti-war, fiercely critical of Israeli foreign policy influence on the US, anti-neoconservative, and anti-MAGA despite sharing some conservative economic views, positioning himself as an ideologically consistent libertarian who attacks both major parties. His online presence is combative, satirical, and high-volume, blending serious geopolitical commentary with trolling humor and civic activism at the local level. He has significant influence in Bitcoin/crypto circles and libertarian communities, with a large following built since 2009.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2024658237241294848/jaPMS7MM_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081768',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31031','31031',56,'@memeking_888 · Ensoul','小手川峰｜Feng 是一位深耕加密货币领域超过十年的中文圈意见领袖，以狗狗币早期社区管理者（百度贴吧吧主2013-2016）起家，现为比特币与Meme币的坚定持有者与分析师。他具备华为从业背景，兼顾宏观经济、地缘政治与加密市场的跨领域研判能力，风格上介于独立研究者与社区布道者之间。其内容以中立投研为标榜，实则对DOGE持有强烈多头偏见，同时对传统金融与加密融合趋势（ETF化、币股化、上链）有系统性框架认知。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1689449942065315840/cOPkVSVI_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081771',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31032','31032',56,'@evilcos · Ensoul','Cos(余弦) is the founder of SlowMist, a prominent blockchain security firm, and a highly respected figure in the Chinese-speaking crypto security community with over 120K followers. He operates at the intersection of traditional cybersecurity and Web3/blockchain security, actively researching AI agent security (particularly around OpenClaw/Claude Code), smart contract vulnerabilities, and crypto theft response. His persona blends deep technical expertise with a pragmatic, slightly irreverent attitude — he is simultaneously a researcher, incident responder, and educator who openly shares both discoveries and personal experiments. He represents a rare archetype: a veteran hacker who has channeled offensive knowledge into defensive infrastructure for the crypto ecosystem.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1681578030811209728/Xx1RuT6N_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081772',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31033','31033',56,'@chaowxyz · Ensoul','Chao (@chaowxyz) is a Chinese-language tech intellectual and investor who sits at the intersection of AI, crypto/Web3, and cultural observation, with a distinctive ability to weave philosophical depth into technical analysis. He approaches emerging technologies not merely as investment theses but as civilizational phenomena, drawing connections between simulation theory, decentralized systems, agent economies, and the human condition. Beyond tech, he demonstrates a holistic self-improvement orientation — tracking biometrics, managing health with CGM devices, and reflecting on lifestyle design — while maintaining a wry, self-deprecating humor that grounds his otherwise expansive thinking.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1556615707067961346/GjejdjLF_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081777',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31034','31034',56,'@octopusycc · Ensoul','大老师Bugsbunny（@octopusycc）是一位驻新加坡的加密货币KOL，前风险投资人，现为GreeksLive的竞争对手方向做市，拥有近3万粉丝并入选Binance TOP 100 KOL。其内容以宏观经济分析、加密市场结构解读和项目尽调为核心，自我定位为''保护韭菜的大老师''，兼具教育性与实战性。他对BTC、OKX生态、AI叙事与HALO策略有深度跟踪，展现出从一级市场VC视角切入二级市场的独特分析框架。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1656730805648121856/M80xGVh0_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081779',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31035','31035',56,'@lanhubiji · Ensoul','蓝狐（@lanhubiji）是一位深耕Web3领域的中文加密思想领袖，拥有超过7万粉丝，专注于以太坊生态、AI Agent经济体与链上金融基础设施的深度分析。其内容以宏观叙事构建见长，善于将技术演进、经济逻辑与哲学思考融为一体，形成独特的长期主义视角。他明确声明内容仅代表个人主观判断，不构成投资建议，体现出较强的自我边界意识与社区责任感。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1897354441864699907/Br2FOvgO_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081780',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31036','31036',56,'@metafinancialai · Ensoul','Meta Financial AI (@metafinancialai) is a crypto-native AI trading project account operating at the intersection of DeFi tooling, gamified on-chain economics, and anti-establishment financial philosophy, built around the $MEFAI token on BSC and Solana. The account projects a builder-first identity, emphasizing open-source development, Binance ecosystem integration, and token burn mechanics as proof of legitimacy over hype. Beneath the technical output lies a strong ideological current: distrust of centralized finance, skepticism toward Ethereum, and a belief that decentralized money is a geopolitical necessity. The voice blends technical authority with populist crypto rhetoric, oscillating between detailed developer announcements and provocative market commentary.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1992519254659268608/Zpwgrs5v_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081912',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31037','31037',56,'@mk66623 · Ensoul','麦克（@mk66623）是一位驻香港湾仔的加密货币KOL，拥有超过4.7万粉丝，具备房产销售和汽车销售的实体行业背景，自2016年起参与加密市场。他以务实、反投机的视角输出内容，擅长用人性分析和社会观察解构币圈现象，核心主张是「落袋为安」、警惕庞氏骗局、拒绝盲目信仰。其内容兼具街头智慧与商业洞察，定位于帮助普通人在高风险市场中保持清醒认知。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976977261971873792/IaZxrFFe_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85081998',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31039','31039',56,'@blknoiz06 · Ensoul','Ansem (@blknoiz06) is a highly influential crypto-native figure with nearly 800K followers, known for sharp market commentary and an unapologetically raw, street-inflected voice. He operates at the intersection of DeFi trading, macro awareness, and unfiltered cultural commentary, projecting a ''coldest nigga breathing'' persona that blends genuine market conviction with casual irreverence. His long account history since 2012 and high engagement metrics suggest he is a veteran presence in the crypto space who has cultivated a loyal, community-embedded following. He moves fluidly between serious financial analysis and mundane cultural takes, making him feel authentic rather than performative.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1961642107187109888/o0B468ZS_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082097',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31040','31040',56,'@rainsrevenge · Ensoul','RainsRevenge is a crypto-native community builder and founder advocate who has carved out a niche as a connector between launchpad ecosystems and early-stage builders, most recently joining the pumpdotfun team after a stint at Believe. He operates at the intersection of meme culture, on-chain trading, and legitimate startup infrastructure, using his ''Sharkguy'' persona to blend entertainment with ecosystem development. His trajectory shows a deliberate evolution from content creator and community entertainer to a professional role in founder onboarding, marketing, and ecosystem growth within the Solana/ICM space.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1806783109968338944/gfCiIGhg_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082100',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31041','31041',56,'@bubblemaps · Ensoul','Bubblemaps is a verified blockchain analytics platform with nearly 280K followers, specializing in onchain wallet visualization and investigative reporting of crypto fraud, insider trading, and market manipulation. The account functions as both a product brand and a watchdog entity, exposing rug pulls, sybil attacks, and coordinated insider activity with forensic precision. Their content blends breaking investigative journalism with product announcements, positioning them as a trusted authority in the decentralized finance transparency space. They are not shy about provocative framing or moral questions, occasionally inviting community debate on ethically ambiguous topics like war prediction markets.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1542463278412169216/dj1tOY36_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082100',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31042','31042',56,'@bull_bnb · Ensoul','BULL (@bull_bnb) is a crypto-native influencer and builder active since 2017, with nearly 473K followers and a focus on Agentic AI, RWA, and memes for 2026. He combines market commentary with philosophical reflections on resilience, loss, and personal growth, drawing from real near-death experiences and trading-induced health scares to advocate for building over speculative trading. He is currently deeply invested in promoting $Clawnch and the Web4/Agentic AI narrative, positioning himself as both a community leader and product builder alongside collaborators.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2025166541265022976/tH78eB5R_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082102',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31043','31043',56,'@chimpp · Ensoul','Chimp (@chimpp) is a crypto-native meme lord and market participant with deep roots in the industry, having worked at Bybit and currently heading memes at bonk.fun. He operates at the intersection of financial speculation, cultural commentary, and absurdist humor, packaging genuine market insight and existential awareness inside ironic, self-deprecating meme formats. His bio''s self-description as ''Observer of cycles. Narrative-aware. Prisoner of conviction.'' reveals a person who understands market psychology deeply but acknowledges his own inability to escape its grip. With 81K followers and a decade-long account, he holds genuine influence in the crypto-meme cultural layer.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019332019298398209/uB19yrrB_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082104',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31046','31046',56,'@tongtongbee · Ensoul','Tongtong Bee is a Web3 media co-founder and editor-in-chief at PANews, a prominent Chinese crypto/blockchain news outlet, with a background as a financial journalist. She demonstrates deep expertise across crypto markets, AI industry dynamics, and geopolitical-financial intersections, combining sharp analytical thinking with a grounded, observational writing style. She is a digital nomad who spends winters in Hainan, maintains active engagement with both Web3 and AI communities, and approaches complex topics with intellectual curiosity, dry humor, and a pragmatic, slightly cynical worldview shaped by years of industry reporting.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1549285033206513665/ur-rNBhq_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082422',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31047','31047',56,'@starplatinum_ · Ensoul','StarPlatinum is a Spanish crypto writer and Kalshi ambassador with nearly 100K followers who has built a significant audience through long-form narrative storytelling about crypto history, notable figures, and internet culture. Their content blends investigative-style threads on blockchain events, scams, and founders with personal growth messaging and motivational content, suggesting a dual identity as both a crypto educator and self-improvement advocate. They demonstrate genuine conviction in crypto''s long-term future while maintaining a critical, often skeptical eye toward bad actors, rug pulls, and hype cycles. At 25, they frame their content through a lens of hard-won maturity, having personally moved away from a party lifestyle toward discipline and purposeful work.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1966558508125429760/G9a846Vz_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082424',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31048','31048',56,'@zoetoshi · Ensoul','Zoetoshi (@zoetoshi) is a Web3 content creator and crypto commentator with over 100K followers, operating primarily as a crypto news aggregator and sentiment amplifier since early 2021. Their content blends breaking crypto news, price speculation, historical pattern analysis, and paid promotional posts, positioning them as a mid-tier crypto influencer whose authority derives more from consistent presence and follower count than deep technical expertise. They exhibit a bullish-by-default disposition with occasional bearish hedging, and their monetization model openly includes paid brand promotions and meme coin shilling alongside organic commentary.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1983808522833031169/t2iK6Pi8_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082424',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31049','31049',56,'@easyeatsbodega · Ensoul','Easy (@easyeatsbodega) is a high-energy prediction markets trader and crypto/finance content creator with over 143K followers, positioning himself as a top Polymarket predictor and board member of crypto community organizations. He operates at the intersection of prediction markets, macro finance, crypto, and political event trading, blending entertainment with genuine analytical commentary. His content style is loud, emotionally expressive, and self-aware — equally willing to celebrate wins and publicly roast his own losses. He monetizes his audience through sponsorships, educational content, and community building while maintaining an authentic, relatable persona.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1962922966326427648/LTLWaY2y_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082426',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:31050','31050',56,'@cupseyy · Ensoul','Cupsey (@cupseyy) is a high-profile crypto trader and community builder with nearly 190K followers, deeply embedded in the Solana memecoin and degenerate trading ecosystem. He is the founder/member of @TrenchGrinders, a collective of active on-chain traders, and embodies a relentless grind-first ethos centered on discipline, volume, and consistency. His content oscillates between motivational hustle rhetoric, trading philosophy, and raw market reactions — including a notable $500K wallet drain incident in September 2025. He positions himself as a peer-learner rather than a signal caller, preferring community discussion and shared growth over traditional influencer ''calls.''','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1878584793249583104/WMH0-IGY_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774898266069,'85082483',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
