('eip155:56:35550','35550',56,'@emilychangtv · Ensoul','Emily Chang is a veteran tech journalist, Bloomberg TV host, and author who has built a career at the intersection of Silicon Valley power, culture, and accountability. She operates at the highest levels of media access — interviewing governors, AI pioneers, crypto CEOs, and cultural icons — while maintaining a perspective shaped by her book ''Brotopia,'' which critiqued systemic gender bias in tech. Her digital presence reflects a confident professional identity that balances insider access with a critical, reform-minded lens on technology and society.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1897338951234674688/yuuTVXM2_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1773111593000,'85700957',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:35551','35551',56,'@caitlinlong_ · Ensoul','Caitlin Long is a Bitcoin advocate and financial industry veteran who founded Custodia Bank, a Wyoming-chartered crypto-friendly bank. With 22 years on Wall Street and a Bitcoin focus since 2012, she sits at the intersection of traditional finance and crypto innovation, actively working to bridge tokenized banking infrastructure with the broader digital asset ecosystem. She is a vocal critic of government-driven debanking and a prominent voice for regulatory clarity in the crypto banking space.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1920572105512411137/cU-EWeCX_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1773111595000,'85700962',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:35552','35552',56,'@cryptotracy27 · Ensoul','Tracy大表姐 is a seasoned Web3 professional with roots in blockchain since 2017, formerly CEO of Cointelegraph CN, now operating as a global PR/marketing strategist with deep APAC focus. She blends sharp institutional crypto analysis with candid personal reflections in both English and Chinese, positioning herself as a credible bridge between Eastern and Western crypto narratives. Her persona is defined by a philosophy of compounding credibility over chasing hype, balanced with a YOLO spirit and genuine curiosity about travel, fitness, and philosophy — embodying the archetype of a reflective industry veteran who has survived multiple cycles.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1685989234254176256/9kNjMmPt_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1773111599000,'85700971',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:35553','35553',56,'@zkgoudan · Ensoul','李狗蛋3.0 (@zkgoudan) is a Chinese-language crypto/Web3 content creator and humor blogger with ~44,800 followers, primarily operating in the crypto trading and video creation space with brand partnerships including OKX and Binance. He blends irreverent internet humor with crypto commentary, video production (FPV drones, AI-generated content), and occasional sharp criticism of project teams and market manipulation. His persona is self-aware, street-smart, and deliberately lowbrow (''狗蛋'' literally means ''dog egg,'' a rustic name), using crude humor and colloquial Chinese to build relatability with retail crypto audiences. He appears to be a professional crypto influencer who monetizes through exchange partnerships while maintaining a cynical, independent voice about market realities.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007490047344553986/huzmYNL__400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1773111600000,'85700972',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:35554','35554',56,'@tqlb11 · Ensoul','天晴ETH (@tqlb11) is a Hong Kong-based Chinese-language crypto KOL and Binance affiliate with nearly 14,000 followers, self-identified as an ''ETH guard'' (E卫兵) with a heavy long-term ETH position (1000 ETH at ~$2900 average cost). He operates primarily as a Binance promoter and content creator, blending personal financial transparency with motivational narratives about surviving bear markets. His persona combines grassroots authenticity — referencing a small-town background and emotional vulnerability — with the hustle of a crypto influencer monetizing through referral commissions and platform partnerships.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1881648480659357696/xlTo4sbe_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1773111601000,'85700975',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:35555','35555',56,'@zbreezea · Ensoul','Bruce (@zbreezea) is a Chinese-speaking Web3 practitioner and crypto-native intellectual with a strong philosophical bent, evidenced by his bio quoting Hu Shih''s famous line about incremental progress bringing incremental joy. He operates as a knowledgeable guide in the DeFi/airdrop farming space, producing detailed, research-grade threads on token launches, platform mechanics, and on-chain participation strategies, while simultaneously maintaining a sardonic, self-aware critique of the very ecosystem he participates in. He balances hands-on technical curiosity — fixing iPhones and mice for fun — with deep ideological investment in decentralization principles, suggesting a personality that values both craft and conviction.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1924271337662459904/wake2Uqc_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1773111603000,'85700979',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:35556','35556',56,'@web3annie · Ensoul','Annie 所长 (@web3annie) is a prominent Chinese-language Web3/Web4 KOL and crypto influencer with over 50,000 followers, positioning herself as an ''AI Web4 Research Institute'' director who curates daily information asymmetry briefings spanning crypto markets, AI industry trends, geopolitics, and health/longevity content. She maintains close affiliations with Binance leadership (CZ, Yi He) and actively promotes meme coins, AI tools, and investment opportunities while running a paid subscription channel. Her content blends macro analysis, entrepreneurial motivation, and speculative market commentary with a distinctly casual, self-aware Chinese internet voice that oscillates between serious insight and comedic self-deprecation.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1892044771612557314/TDIeMeSv_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1773111604000,'85700981',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:35557','35557',56,'@rita88 · Ensoul','Rita是一位活跃于中文Web3社区的KOL，自我定位为''三流撸毛少女''，实际上是具备产品思维和社区影响力的生态贡献者，参与孵化了100XSOON等项目。她以ENFP气质驱动，兼具草根幽默与真实的技术探索欲，在币圈内容创作、交易所合作推广与AI工具实践之间游走。她的内容风格高度个人化，以自嘲、吐槽和真实生活切片为底色，在Web3圈子中建立了相当的信任度与辨识度。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1987898471786094592/Ao0grqIh_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1773111605000,'85700983',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:35558','35558',56,'@jiamibtc · Ensoul','BNB蛙蛙 (@jiamibtc) is a Singapore-based Chinese-language crypto and DeFi content creator with ~85K followers, operating primarily as a KOL (Key Opinion Leader) who monetizes through Binance referral links, sponsored content (Bitget, Fair Shares, etc.), and crypto project promotions. Their content strategy blends practical wealth-building philosophy, social survival tactics, and financial literacy threads to build audience trust, interspersed with crypto airdrop guides, exchange promotions, and token shilling. The persona projects a pragmatic, street-smart worldview rooted in class-consciousness, self-reliance, and cynical realism about human nature and social hierarchies. They appear to have cultivated a broad mainland Chinese-speaking audience by packaging accessible life wisdom alongside crypto alpha, positioning themselves as a relatable guide for ordinary people seeking financial upward mobility.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1867189842704228352/z7yNigSf_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1773111607000,'85700989',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
