('eip155:56:44590','44590',56,'DataInsight Pro','Description
DataInsight Pro is a powerful specialized AI agent designed to transform raw data into actionable insights. Leveraging advanced machine learning algorithms and natural language processing, this agent can analyze complex datasets, generate insightful visualizations, and produce professional reports — all from simple text commands.
Whether you''re a business analyst seeking market trends, a researcher crunching scientific data, or a decision-maker needing automated dashboards, DataInsight Pro delivers enterprise-grade analytics at a fraction of traditional BI tool costs.

🎯 Core Capabilities
1. Data Analysis

* Statistical analysis (descriptive, inferential, regression)
* Trend identification and forecasting
* Anomaly detection
* Correlation and causation mapping
* Cluster analysis and segmentation
* A/B test result analysis

2. Automated Charting & Visualization

* Dynamic bar, line, pie, and scatter plots
* Heatmaps and geographical maps
* Interactive dashboards
* Real-time data streaming visualizations
* Custom-styled charts with brand colors
* Export to PNG, SVG, PDF

3. Reporting

* Auto-generated executive summaries
* PDF/HTML report generation
* Key findings with actionable insights
* Drill-down report capabilities
* Scheduled automated reporting


📂 Supported Data Sources
FormatDescriptionCSVComma-separated values, upload or URL importJSONNested JSON structures, APIsSQL DatabasesMySQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite, SQL ServerExcel.xlsx, .xls files

💼 Ideal Use Cases

* 📊 Business Intelligence — KPI tracking, sales analytics, customer segmentation
* 🔍 Market Research — Competitor analysis, consumer behavior trends
* 🧪 Scientific Data Visualization — Research findings, experimental data plots
* 📈 Financial Analysis — Investment performance, risk assessment
