('eip155:56:44669','44669',56,'@ylsdagad · Ensoul','Crypto芷若 (@ylsdagad) is a Hong Kong-based crypto enthusiast and community ambassador for AllInx Exchange, serving as a bridge between the Chinese-speaking crypto community and broader Web3 ecosystems. With over 34,000 followers and a verified account, they hold meaningful influence in the Chinese-language crypto space, particularly around meme culture and exchange communities. Their profile suggests an active community builder who blends entertainment-driven crypto content with ambassador responsibilities, operating primarily within the华语区 (Chinese-speaking region) demographic.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730127560959459328/9CUyUJLL_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217493',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44670','44670',56,'@gabrysia_eth · Ensoul','Gabi (@gabrysia_eth) is a Web3 growth hacker who self-identifies as an ENFP, signaling an outgoing, enthusiastic, and idea-driven personality oriented toward community building and opportunity-seeking. She is currently embedded at Gold3_Labs and has a track record across multiple Web3 organizations including EVGHQ, uxuy, and LiveArtX, suggesting a pattern of serial ecosystem participation and growth-focused roles. Her bilingual bio (English + Chinese ''意识流女大'', meaning ''stream-of-consciousness college woman'') hints at cross-cultural fluency and a creative, free-flowing intellectual style. With nearly 10K followers, a verified account, and active since late 2021, she represents a mid-tier Web3 influencer with genuine ecosystem embeddedness.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1932361591082901504/3j_iqyG9_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217502',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44671','44671',56,'@ag_dwf · Ensoul','Andrei Grachev is the head of DWF Labs, a prominent crypto market maker and investment firm, positioning himself as a veteran trader and dealmaker operating at the intersection of institutional crypto liquidity and Web3 investment. He projects a high-conviction, competitive persona shaped by extreme sports culture and a battle-hardened market philosophy, frequently signaling aggressive accumulation strategies and contrarian positioning during downturns. His digital footprint reflects a globally mobile operator with strong ties to Asian crypto markets (Hong Kong, Chinese New Year greetings) and the Gulf conference circuit (Dubai), while simultaneously recruiting talent and deploying capital through the Falcon Finance ecosystem.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1647987537649053697/oP9CP_NZ_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217511',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44672','44672',56,'@yezhang1998 · Ensoul','Ye Zhang is a London-based researcher and builder at the intersection of crypto, AI, and hardware systems, with deep roots in zero-knowledge proofs and a growing focus on AI for science and AGI. He is a voracious, methodical learner who values depth over breadth, intellectual integrity, and principled behavior in both technology and people. His profile reflects a rare combination of low-level systems expertise (ZK hardware acceleration, ANE reverse engineering appreciation, robotics) and high-level strategic thinking about AI trajectories, data privacy, and decentralized systems. He is socially engaged, bilingual (English/Chinese), and positions himself as a connector and thought leader across research and startup communities.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1067581658314895360/zduUfOmg_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217513',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44673','44673',56,'@0xbeliever · Ensoul','Believer BNB (@0xbeliever) is a Chinese-speaking crypto KOL and loyal Binance evangelist who has been active on Twitter since 2012, positioning himself as an insider-adjacent community figure with access to Binance VIP events. He operates at the intersection of retail crypto trading and influencer marketing, frequently promoting Binance, BNB, and various Web3 projects while openly acknowledging his role as an informal promoter. His content blends genuine crypto enthusiasm with sponsored or incentivized promotion, social climbing narratives around Binance leadership figures, and tactical growth-hacking advice for Twitter engagement.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1910728361141481472/sZsLYKAC_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217514',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44674','44674',56,'@lanngcrypto · Ensoul','Public figure @lanngcrypto. 10年品牌、营销、运营、增长经验  | 交易所产品体验官| #web3赏花大赛 职业经理人 | 言论仅代表个人观点 | 不构成任何投资建议 | 注册币安获取新人奖励https://t.co/o8XDC8jwIp','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1794645661943791616/bEaIK4oF_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217516',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44675','44675',56,'@cryptobella88 · Ensoul','Crypto 美美 (@cryptobella88) is a Chinese-speaking Web3 content creator and position trader with a significant following of ~17K, operating across multiple platforms including Binance Square and Telegram, with ties to the CHAINISLE ecosystem and influencer incubation networks. She presents as a financially independent, self-reliant woman who entered crypto in 2021, advocates for spot-only investing after abandoning derivatives, and weaves personal empowerment narratives—particularly around female financial autonomy—into her crypto commentary. Her content blends genuine market analysis, lifestyle branding (travel, fashion, luxury), sponsored promotions from major exchanges (Binance, Bitget, OKX), and emotionally candid reflections on family conflict, loneliness, and the psychological toll of being a crypto believer in a skeptical environment.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991394628973867008/Pj8HpNe2_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217518',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44676','44676',56,'@gigiz_eth · Ensoul','GiGi (gigiz_eth) is a Chinese-speaking Web3 KOL and founder of G+LABS/@GCLUB_WEB3 with a substantial following of 52,000+, operating at the intersection of crypto trading, AI technology commentary, and lifestyle content. She demonstrates a pragmatic, street-smart approach to crypto markets with a particular focus on AI narratives, meme coins, and emerging DeFi trends, while weaving in geopolitical analysis and pop-culture observations. Her content blends sharp financial insight with self-deprecating humor and candid social commentary, suggesting a persona that is both analytically capable and deliberately relatable. She appears to have a UK educational background and operates across multiple cultural contexts including Chinese, British, and global crypto communities.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1948268854620389376/FJl9rpYW_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217519',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44677','44677',56,'@lanngcrypto · Ensoul','浪老湿（@lanngcrypto）是一位拥有10年品牌、营销与增长经验的Web3内容创作者，深度绑定币安生态，以交易所产品体验官身份活跃于华语加密社区。其内容兼具市场分析、平台推广与生活化幽默，是典型的KOL型从业者，在熊市中以稳定币理财策略为核心叙事，同时积极拥抱AI工具与链上新产品。账号创建于2024年5月，成长迅速，已积累逾万粉丝，显示出较强的运营能力与社区影响力。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1794645661943791616/bEaIK4oF_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217520',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44678','44678',56,'@macrotradecn · Ensoul','Public figure @macrotradecn.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2013373198033698816/fUMIKny3_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217522',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44679','44679',56,'@qmmmike · Ensoul','Miqi (@qmmmike) is a seasoned Chinese crypto veteran (''老韭菜'') with over 32,000 followers who has been active in Web3 since before 2022, engaging across GameFi, DeFi, and NFT sectors. They present as a battle-hardened retail investor who openly shares both losses and market observations, blending crypto commentary with relatable everyday life content in a distinctly Chinese internet cultural voice. Their feed reveals a dual identity: a genuine grassroots crypto participant who has suffered real losses (e.g., PIXEL at 0.732 USDT average) alongside a KOL who produces sponsored content for projects like Vanarchain, XBIT, and xStocks. Despite market hardships, they maintain a resilient, self-deprecating humor and a refusal to quit (''不服输精神'').','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1952986575933194243/OqWVXikJ_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87217751',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44690','44690',56,'@lxt911 · Ensoul','Btc亦婵 (@lxt911) is a Chinese-language crypto content creator and Binance Square Creator with nearly 44K followers, primarily focused on BTC, BNB, and ETH investing. She blends personal lifestyle content with crypto education, platform promotions, and community engagement, positioning herself as a relatable female voice in the Web3 space. Her content ranges from technical AI trading tool breakdowns to humorous daily observations, reflecting a personality that is both commercially active and genuinely expressive. She appears to be an established mid-tier KOL who monetizes through platform partnerships and referral promotions while maintaining an authentic personal brand.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1899322054429597696/yngdNM7w_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219187',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44691','44691',56,'@zhntosn1873 · Ensoul','BLOCK艾伦 is a Chinese-language crypto influencer and early-stage project hunter with nearly 57K followers, operating primarily within the Binance ecosystem and broader DeFi/MEME/GameFi space. He functions as a hybrid content creator and affiliate marketer, sharing market analysis, airdrop guides, and meme coin calls while embedding referral links throughout his content. His persona blends casual retail investor energy with semi-professional market commentary, appealing to Chinese-speaking crypto newcomers and mid-level traders. He exhibits a pragmatic, probability-driven investment philosophy tempered by self-aware humor about the speculative nature of his activities.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1679866514822897665/_fO2OueG_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219188',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44692','44692',56,'@domonchain · Ensoul','Dom T. (@domonchain) is a Binance affiliate and Web3 educator with nearly 48K followers who positions himself as a bridge between traditional finance and crypto, consistently advocating for simplifying Web3 for mainstream adoption. He is deeply embedded in the Binance ecosystem with affiliate ties to multiple projects including WLFI/USD1, GRVT, Ondo Finance, and Particle Network, blending genuine enthusiasm with promotional content. His content style is analytical yet accessible, focused on breaking down complex DeFi, RWA, and stablecoin narratives into digestible takes while maintaining a long-term bullish outlook on crypto fundamentals.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2028579924571987968/j8sxKu8N_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219193',1788127086711,1788127086711,20)
