('eip155:56:44693','44693',56,'@bcecil · Ensoul','Crypto诸葛 (@bcecil) is a Chinese-language crypto KOL and promotional account with over 61,000 followers, operating primarily as a paid promoter for various Web3 projects, exchanges, and token launches. The account blends surface-level market analysis with heavy promotional content spanning DeFi, NFTs, GameFi, AI-crypto, RWA, and meme coins, consistently embedding referral links and sponsored narratives. Despite the ''Zhuge Liang'' (master strategist) branding, the content pattern reveals a monetization-first influencer who amplifies projects in exchange for compensation rather than a genuine independent analyst. The account has been active since 2008 but the crypto-focused persona appears to be a more recent evolution, now functioning as a multi-project shill hub targeting Chinese-speaking retail crypto participants.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2001379326126968832/56hx5VVK_400x400.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219199',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44694','44694',56,'@crypto_l92 · Ensoul','L💢 (@crypto_l92) is a Hong Kong-based Chinese-language crypto KOL and content creator who operates primarily within the Binance ecosystem, promoting exchange activities, launchpad opportunities, meme coins, and DeFi projects to an audience of ~37,700 followers. Their content blends personal lifestyle glimpses (gym sessions, trading during workouts) with promotional crypto content spanning Gate.io, Bitget, JuCom, and various emerging projects, suggesting a multi-platform affiliate/KOL monetization model. They exhibit strong parasocial admiration for Binance leadership figures CZ and Yi He, framing their own crypto journey through the lens of proximity to industry icons. The account, created in late 2023, has grown rapidly and demonstrates consistent engagement with promotional campaigns, launchpad events, and meme coin narratives.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1922958917828739073/PjqurT_T_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219202',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44695','44695',56,'@lsssss1106 · Ensoul','Nuts坚果（@lsssss1106）是一位活跃于币安生态的中文加密货币KOL，以技术分析博主身份运营，同时深度参与币安推荐返佣体系（推荐码NUTS666），兼具交易信号分享、直播带单和社区运营等多重角色。其内容风格轻松接地气，频繁在东南亚旅行，展现出一种游走于加密圈与生活娱乐之间的网红化人设。账号自2023年创建以来积累了1.7万粉丝，具备一定的社区影响力，但内容中商业推广与真实交易分享的边界较为模糊。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1792455986697195520/aL9zCd7x_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219204',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44696','44696',56,'@tintinx2021 · Ensoul','Tintin (@tintinx2021) is a high-influence crypto personality with 55K+ followers who operates at the intersection of DeFi trading, DEX ecosystems, and emerging AI-crypto narratives, with a strong affiliation to the Aster DEX platform and BNB/yzilabs ecosystem. She validates her views through actual trading positions (''用仓位验证自己的答案'' — verifying answers with positions) and participates actively in the crypto conference circuit, having been spotted at events like Solana Breakpoint and CatLumpurr. Her content blends sharp market analysis with self-aware humor, cultural commentary, and community-building energy, suggesting a persona that is both analytically grounded and socially performative. She occupies a KOL/ambassador role in the crypto space, particularly around Aster, Genius Terminal, and emerging prediction market and AI-crypto projects.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1973712932321071104/TvQ8-aFX_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219209',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44697','44697',56,'@drbitcoin36 · Ensoul','比特欧 Elvin (@drbitcoin36) 是一位驻新加坡的00后华人大学生，以数据分析与可视化为核心技能，在中文加密货币社区中以KOL身份活跃，将推特作为个人炒币日记与内容变现平台。他兼具数据博主与Meme交易玩家的双重身份，内容风格在专业加密分析与随性生活吐槽之间自由切换，展现出一个在熊市中挣扎求存、焦虑但不失幽默感的年轻自媒体人形象。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1871549554279194624/SLDJsDr2_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219210',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44698','44698',56,'@cryptoblack0511 · Ensoul','CryptoBLACK是成都集团创始人，一位活跃于Web3生态的KOL和多平台大使，拥有近3万粉丝，在加密货币交易、DeFi、AI Agent等领域具有较强的影响力。他的内容混合了项目推广（Gate、EVEDEX、Binance等）、市场分析与个人生活碎片，展现出一个兼具商业嗅觉与市井烟火气的币圈老韭菜形象。他行事风格直接、接地气，善用幽默和俚语拉近与受众距离，同时也不掩饰其KOL商业变现的本质。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1816081513441792000/mZZ7IL6s_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219214',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44699','44699',56,'@crypto_pumpman · Ensoul','泵泵超人（@crypto_pumpman）是一位深度扎根于币安生态的华语加密内容创作者，拥有超过3.3万粉丝，以投研分析、数据可视化和Vibe Coding为核心标签，活跃于BNB Chain生态系统。他兼具分析师的严谨与玩家的热情，既能输出系统性的项目研究报告，也会亲身参与链上交互、抽卡、预测市场等链上活动，是典型的「研究型参与者」。他与币安生态深度绑定，同时对AI、DeFi、预测市场、TCG等新兴赛道保持高度敏感，内容兼顾深度与趣味性，在华语Web3社区中具有较强的影响力和信任度。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1934990656356945920/LX-doz3z_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219216',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44702','44702',56,'@gamefimaster · Ensoul','0x老法师 is a Chinese-language crypto content creator and Binance Square contributor with over 25,000 followers, operating at the intersection of GameFi, NFT, meme coins, and BRC20 ecosystems. He presents himself as a pragmatic, street-smart veteran of the crypto space who balances promotional content for various Web3 projects with genuine critical commentary on market conditions, AI hype, and the grift economy surrounding crypto education. His persona blends the role of a community entertainer (''福利大魔王'') with occasional moments of authentic self-reflection about the difficulty of navigating bear markets and the predatory nature of the ''course-selling'' industry. He is clearly monetizing his audience through sponsored posts while maintaining enough authentic voice to retain credibility with his community.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1770430686383783936/BS0hicNW_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219438',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44703','44703',56,'@0xlige · Ensoul','0xLige is a Chinese-language crypto KOL (Key Opinion Leader) with ~45K followers, operating primarily in the DeFi/Web3 space since the early DeFi era. They function as a professional content creator and influencer who monetizes their platform through sponsored posts from major exchanges (Binance, OKX, Bitget, BCGame) and emerging crypto projects, while also sharing genuine market analysis and personal opinions. Their content blends promotional material with authentic crypto commentary, trading strategy education, and occasional personal lifestyle posts, reflecting a pragmatic approach to the creator economy in Web3. They are embedded in the Chinese crypto KOL community with real-world relationships with exchange representatives and fellow influencers.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1756564794394710016/im5Zr0ib_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219438',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44704','44704',56,'@evans666666 · Ensoul','Evans.eth is a Chinese-speaking Web3 KOL based in Singapore with Vietnamese and Indonesian connections, operating as a crypto influencer with over 44K followers and a strong affiliation with Binance. He presents himself as a lifestyle-oriented crypto veteran who blends bear market survival wisdom with humor, sponsored content, and community engagement across Southeast Asia. His content mixes genuine market analysis with promotional posts, casual life updates, and sardonic commentary on the crypto cycle, suggesting a persona that monetizes influence while maintaining an approachable, street-smart personality. He appears to be part of a tight-knit Chinese crypto social circle (''成都集团'') and is deeply embedded in the Web3 conference and networking circuit.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1742456654829170688/Ur6oQR9J_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219440',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44705','44705',56,'@elaineyang73 · Ensoul','Elaine Yang (@elaineyang73) is a bilingual Chinese-American investment professional and AI enthusiast based in NYC/Bay Area, operating as an Investment Partner at Alpha Square Group with prior experience as GP at WaterDrip Fund and strategy advisor at Faraday Future. She sits at the intersection of crypto/Web3 investing, AI tooling, robotics hardware, and high-profile social networking, frequently attending elite events like Mar-a-Lago forums and NVIDIA GTC. Her online persona blends serious financial analysis with playful self-deprecating humor, code-switching fluidly between English and Chinese to address distinct audience segments. She is an early and enthusiastic adopter of the OpenClaw/lobster AI ecosystem and positions herself as a one-woman AI-powered builder navigating the convergence of crypto, AI agents, and hardware.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2011615247594110977/CUwmlgwk_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219444',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
