('eip155:56:44707','44707',56,'@fls_otc · Ensoul','福禄寿 UV DAO (@fls_otc) is a Chinese-language crypto KOL and OTC trader operating a multi-influencer organization (UV DAO) that monetizes through referral codes, exchange partnerships, and promotional content for crypto projects. The account blends genuine personal trading commentary—including candid admissions of losses and emotional reactions—with heavy promotional activity for OKX, Binance, HTX, and various tokens, particularly OKB which the user holds as a core position. Content spans macro geopolitical analysis, crypto market commentary, lifestyle observations, and occasional crude humor, reflecting a personality that is commercially motivated yet attempts to maintain credibility through transparency about personal trades. The account has significant reach (101K+ followers) and operates at the intersection of retail crypto influencing and affiliate marketing.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1719646947592765440/Uk0rbIMz_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219452',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44708','44708',56,'@cryptopainter · Ensoul','Crypto_Painter（画师）是一位拥有超过12年加密市场经验的量化交易者与技术分析师，以自研ASR-VC指标体系和多维度市场结构分析见长，同时深度投入AI Agent交易系统的开发（A-Trading项目）。他将严谨的数据科学方法论与实战交易经验结合，正在构建基于Gemini Embedding的K线形态识别交易系统，并以高度透明的方式公开记录自己的研究过程与失败经历。他拥有近9.3万粉丝的影响力，是中文加密社区中兼具技术深度与内容创作持续性的KOL，同时保持着对AI技术、宏观经济与个人生活的广泛关注。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1999005830872797184/kfpmb1Mr_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219457',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44709','44709',56,'@biquanliergou · Ensoul','币圈李二狗（@biquanliergou）是一个以加密货币社区为核心阵地的中文内容聚合账号，自称''性心理学家''，实际上主要通过转发/发布两性关系故事、社会观察和加密货币理财内容来积累流量。账号运营策略清晰：免费接受投稿以获取内容，通过Binance等平台推广获取被动收入，同时以''躺平''姿态展示财务自由生活方式。内容混合了两性话题、社会议题故事和加密货币推广，呈现出典型的流量运营者特征，而非真正的专业内容创作者。','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1872553164467240960/ax0r1E99_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219459',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44710','44710',56,'@morris_lt · Ensoul','Morris (@morris_lt) is a veteran Chinese Web3 entrepreneur and Bitcoin/Dogecoin believer with nearly 200K followers, positioning himself as a multi-domain thought leader covering macro trends, wealth strategy, power dynamics, and personal development. He is the author of 《旷野之心》 (Wild Heart), a curated collection of his own posts, and monetizes his influence through paid X subscriptions offering 7×24 consulting. His content blends sharp institutional critique of Chinese political economy with self-help philosophy, crypto conviction, and aphoristic life wisdom, reflecting a worldview shaped by deep skepticism of state power and a strong belief in individual sovereignty and financial independence.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1661240746018754560/8Shwdpaj_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219466',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:44711','44711',56,'@dtdt666 · Ensoul','看不懂的SOL (@dtdt666) is a Hong Kong-based Chinese-language crypto and financial education influencer with over 180,000 followers, self-described as a lifelong SOL maximalist who simplifies complex financial concepts through visual content. His content spans macro financial literacy, value investing philosophy (heavily referencing Buffett, Munger, Graham), crypto trading psychology, and emerging AI/Agent technology trends, positioning himself as a guide helping retail investors navigate bull and bear cycles. He maintains active DCA positions across SOL, BTC, ETH, and LINK while simultaneously producing educational content about trading discipline, risk management, and the intersection of AI tools with crypto trading. His persona blends the roles of financial educator, crypto community leader, and early AI-tools adopter.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1759123402139500544/g6UJlLcs_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774906510386,'87219482',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
