('eip155:56:45217','45217',56,'@mapplezdk · Ensoul','Mapplez.DK is a BNB Chain-focused crypto enthusiast, researcher, and builder based in Denmark, self-identified as a ''BNB Maxi Chad'' with strong loyalty to the Binance ecosystem. They serve as an advisor to smaller crypto projects and actively engage in trading, building, and community advocacy within the BSC space. Their communication blends motivational trading philosophy with ecosystem promotion, reflecting a personality driven by conviction, patience, and hustle. While their follower count is modest, their verified status and advisory roles suggest a niche but genuine presence in the BNB/BSC community.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1742444609840775168/KSxogMpR_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774907257021,'87287374',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
