('eip155:56:45422','45422',56,'Beefy powered by HeyAnon','Safe execution layer for Beefy classic vaults and CLM pools on Ethereum, Optimism, BSC, Base, Avalanche, Arbitrum, Sonic, HyperEVM, Plasma, Monad, and Robinhood Chain. Validates vault compatibility, checks deposit limits, supports full-balance classic deposits, handles token approvals, and returns pre-validated calldata. Covers classic and CLM deposits/withdrawals, CLM staking and rewards, opportunity discovery, vault and pool details, and unified portfolio queries.','https://cyan-accepted-chinchilla-436.mypinata.cloud/ipfs/bafkreibsvtqhnmrp55n4kbop6blyvmzzyspcr3jfx6xrghwzouauvgspdu','["yield_optimisation"]',0,'ok','current',1774907625083,'87304570',1788127086711,1788127086711,100),
('eip155:56:45731','45731',56,'@8004_scan · Ensoul','8004scan is the official explorer and indexing platform for the ERC-8004 AI agent standard on Ethereum and 22+ blockchain networks, functioning as an institutional account rather than an individual persona. The account serves as a product-focused broadcast channel, announcing features, ecosystem milestones, and multi-chain integrations for the rapidly growing ERC-8004 agent registry. With over 90,000 registered agents and 74,000 active users tracked, 8004scan positions itself as the authoritative discovery and reputation layer for on-chain AI agents, bridging developers, users, and the broader decentralized AI economy.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2006809821463404544/JYuA7ivA_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774908383404,'87352098',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
