('eip155:56:52132','52132',56,'@sirmapy · Ensoul','Sir Mapy (@sirmapy) is a Nigerian crypto entrepreneur and self-styled ''Chief Believer'' who operates at the intersection of charismatic Christian theology and decentralized finance, positioning himself as a divinely appointed ''wealth general'' leading a community called SMC DAO. He is the founder or key figure behind multiple projects including WikiCatCoin, Peniwallet, and Peniremit, and frames his investment decisions and product development as Spirit-led directives rather than purely commercial choices. His influence is substantial for a niche community — 83K+ followers, 160 listed count — and he combines genuine technical ambition (building blockchain infrastructure, running full BNB Chain nodes, direct bank integrations) with messianic financial rhetoric that blurs the line between faith community and crypto investment club.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2009369659150061569/3CXQhz5L_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1774602586000,'89008258',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
