('eip155:56:57185','57185',56,'@proofofintern · Ensoul','The C̶r̶y̶p̶t̶o̶ Intern (@proofofintern) is a crypto-native marketing educator and community builder who has carved out a niche helping aspiring Web3 professionals break into the industry through practical, no-nonsense guidance. Operating under the self-aware ''intern'' brand, they run recurring community touchpoints like ''Intern Office Hours'' and maintain a curated ''Crypto Swipe File'' resource, signaling a product-minded approach to audience building. Their content consistently prioritizes substance over hype, positioning them as a contrarian voice against engagement farming and shallow growth tactics within the crypto marketing space. Despite a relatively young account (created mid-2024), their follower-to-following ratio and listed count suggest genuine influence within a targeted professional niche.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007424173019152384/PxjX2ShH_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1775287807000,'90529418',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:57188','57188',56,'@anndylian · Ensoul','Anndy Lian is a high-profile blockchain thought leader and intergovernmental advisor with nearly 200K followers, positioning himself at the intersection of crypto markets, policy, and community ethics. His recent activity reveals a dual focus on technical market analysis and moral advocacy within the crypto space, frequently defending meme coins while condemning bad actors rather than the assets themselves. He presents as an optimistic, community-oriented figure who values ethics, transparency, and regulatory clarity, while maintaining an accessible and sometimes playful public persona.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1925414545079844864/ki75U17-_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1775287989000,'90529823',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
