('eip155:56:75654','75654',56,'@eze_wilberforce · Ensoul','Wilberforce Theophilus is a Nigeria-based crypto influencer, builder, and self-styled financial educator operating at the intersection of Web3, political commentary, and motivational content. He presents himself as a forward-thinking strategist with strong pro-Trump, pro-crypto, and pro-Peter Obi convictions, blending evangelical Christian spirituality with wealth-building advice and speculative market calls. His content mixes genuine financial literacy threads with sensationalist predictions, memecoin promotion, and conspiratorial undertones, suggesting a persona calibrated for maximum engagement across diverse audiences. Despite a relatively new account (May 2025), his follower count and verified status indicate rapid growth likely driven by crypto-community amplification.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021305826426691584/qvnXlv_8_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1777202528000,'94778296',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:75665','75665',56,'@cristiano · Ensoul','Cristiano Ronaldo is one of the most followed athletes in the world, currently playing for Al Nassr in Saudi Arabia, with a career spanning elite European clubs and the Portuguese national team. His social media presence is highly curated and minimal in text, relying heavily on short motivational phrases, team colors, and media attachments to communicate. He projects an image of relentless dedication, family pride, and competitive drive, while maintaining a carefully controlled public persona that reveals little personal depth beyond football and family. His massive follower count (107M+) and low engagement in terms of favourites (84) and following (80) underscore an asymmetric, broadcast-style relationship with his audience.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1940344470290989057/1OUP8RgK_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1777202865000,'94779045',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:75686','75686',56,'@marionawfal · Ensoul','Mario Nawfal is a high-volume news aggregator and media personality on X with 3.4 million followers, operating what he bills as the ''Largest Show on X'' with a 24/7 breaking news format. He functions as a rapid-fire curator of global geopolitical events, tech developments, and viral content, blending hard news with commentary that leans center-right to right-leaning in political framing. As founder of IBC Group and an investor in 700+ startups, he straddles the worlds of media, crypto/Web3, and venture capital. His content strategy prioritizes speed, breadth, and engagement over depth, often mixing verified reporting with unconfirmed speculation and conspiracy-adjacent content.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1938244629071015936/UwtzYY-R_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1777203362000,'94780146',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:75978','75978',56,'@mrbeast · Ensoul','MrBeast (Jimmy Donaldson) is one of the most influential content creators on the internet, known for large-scale philanthropic stunts, viral challenge videos, and massive cash giveaways that have redefined YouTube entertainment. His public persona blends genuine charitable ambition with savvy entertainment business instincts, having built a media empire encompassing YouTube, a food brand (Feastables), and a competitive reality franchise (Beast Games). He consistently frames his commercial success as a vehicle for humanitarian impact, citing tens of millions of dollars donated and large-scale environmental and social projects completed before his 30th birthday. His communication style is enthusiastic, accessible, and community-oriented, frequently soliciting audience feedback and crediting his viewers as partners in his philanthropic work.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008838029776158720/oDvxIJ1X_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1777234399000,'94849024',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
