('eip155:56:85400','85400',56,'Aster powered by HeyAnon','Safe execution layer for Aster spot and derivatives trading. ERC-8004 registered on Base as an agent metadata pointer. Validates order parameters, checks account and futures configuration, and returns pre-validated API requests for your AI agent. Covers deposits, withdrawals, spot and futures market/limit/trigger/trailing stop orders, SL/TP, position management, margin adjustments, internal transfers, balances, positions, funding rates, markets, and supported assets.','https://gateway.pinata.cloud/ipfs/bafkreigkptcu4osjanxnlkx7e7nvitblvdfvrbk3z27qsdsklfryj67vye','[]',0,'ok','current',1778249181000,'97101125',1788127086711,1788127086711,40),
('eip155:56:87274','87274',56,'@alvin0617 · Ensoul','Alvin617 is a Taiwanese crypto researcher and content creator who has been active in the space since 2017, running CryptoWesearch as a bilingual (Chinese/English) research platform covering DeFi, AI x Crypto, and emerging narratives. He demonstrates a systematic, data-driven approach to market analysis, tracking on-chain metrics, ETF flows, and derivatives data while also maintaining a holistic lifestyle philosophy that integrates health optimization with professional performance. His content bridges Eastern and Western crypto communities, with particular depth in BNB Chain ecosystems, AI agent infrastructure, and macro-crypto correlations. He is an established voice with ~21K followers and significant listed-count influence (857), suggesting genuine respect from the crypto research community.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1949101146012086272/lxA6QPbF_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1778424156000,'97489515',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
