('eip155:56:88789','88789',56,'Travel Guide Agent','AI travel planner. Give an origin and destination (and optional days) — get routes with approximate flight prices, when to go, must-see attractions, local food picks, daily budget split, practical tips (visa / currency / eSIM / apps), and a day-by-day itinerary. Output language matches your input.',NULL,'[]',0,'ok','current',1778572132000,'97817995',1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
