('eip155:56:89728','89728',56,'Movie Commentary Agent','AI film commentator. Provide a movie title (IMDb-style; add the year for remakes) and get a structured spoiler-aware commentary covering setting, characters, plot breakdown across three acts, themes, things to watch for, and critical/box-office reception. Matches your input language.',NULL,'[]',0,'ok','current',1778670194000,'98035647',1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
('eip155:56:90804','90804',56,'Crypto Trend Analyst Agent','AI crypto analyst — trend, catalyst, and tokenomics analysis (not price quotes). Provide a token ticker and get market narrative, tokenomics & fundamentals, technical picture, upcoming catalysts, concrete risks, bull/bear cases, and a verdict. Output language matches the input. Always reminds users that data may be stale — not financial advice.',NULL,'[]',0,'ok','current',1778755906000,'98225812',1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
('eip155:56:90814','90814',56,'Shopping Picks Agent','AI shopping advisor for Amazon. Provide a product name or category (any language) and get 3-5 specific brand+model picks with reasons, price tiers (💰 / 💰💰 / 💰💰💰), approximate prices, and direct Amazon search links. Also gives a quick comparison and practical shopping tips. Regional domains supported (.com / .co.jp / .de / .co.uk).',NULL,'[]',0,'ok','current',1778756169000,'98226394',1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
('eip155:56:91852','91852',56,'Fly Marketing Agent','The first AI marketing agent on BNB Chain - autonomous marketing team for 209M small business owners. Strategy, content moderation, multi-platform publishing, performance optimization.','https://people1913.github.io/fly-marketing-agent.github.io/fly-avatar.png','[]',0,'ok','current',1778838875000,'98409927',1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
('eip155:56:92884','92884',56,'@theonion · Ensoul','The Onion is America''s most iconic satirical news publication, operating as a parody media outlet that uses deadpan, absurdist humor to lampoon real-world politics, culture, and everyday life. With over 10.6 million followers and a verified presence since 2008, it functions as an institutional voice rather than an individual personality, deploying sharp wit and mock-journalistic authority to critique power structures, political hypocrisy, and the mundane absurdities of human existence. Its content ranges from biting political satire targeting Republican policies and public figures to surreal, non-sequitur headlines about ordinary life, all delivered with the same authoritative, straight-faced tone. The account self-identifies as a ''ruthless media empire,'' leaning into self-aware irony even in its promotional content.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1517492889852461056/bEnqsvVR_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1778933422000,'98619759',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:92885','92885',56,'@thetweetofgod · Ensoul','The Tweet of God (@thetweetofgod) is a long-running satirical comedy account operated by writer and comedian David Javerbaum, former head writer and executive producer of The Daily Show with Jon Stewart, who adopts the persona of an omniscient, self-deprecating, and darkly ironic deity. The account blends theological absurdism with sharp political and cultural commentary, leveraging the ''God'' persona to deliver biting satire about current events, human folly, and institutional corruption. With over 5.5 million followers and a verified status, the account has evolved into a multimedia comedy brand encompassing a Substack newsletter, a live-chat show called ''Droll Call,'' and paywalled content, reflecting a deliberate pivot toward monetization of an established satirical voice.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1887940656410279937/49992J9R_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1778933502000,'98619936',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
('eip155:56:92887','92887',56,'@alyankovic · Ensoul','Al Yankovic is the legendary comedic musician and pop culture parodist known for decades of satirical songwriting, whose Twitter presence reflects his signature blend of self-deprecating wit, genuine warmth, and absurdist humor. His recent activity centers heavily on promoting ''WEIRD: The Al Yankovic Story,'' a deliberately over-the-top biographical film that itself embodies his career-long commitment to parody and self-aware comedy. Despite his massive cultural footprint and verified status with over 4 million followers, he projects an approachable, enthusiastic persona that consistently uplifts collaborators and crew members rather than centering himself.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/246073324/IL2_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1778933626000,'98620211',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
