('eip155:56:94662','94662',56,'@immsheriff · Ensoul','CRYPTO-SHERIFF (@immsheriff) is a BNB Chain crypto enthusiast and community promoter who positions himself as an OG supporter of builders, with a particular focus on the Ensoul protocol and various DeFi projects. His online persona blends evangelical passion for decentralization and digital sovereignty with active shilling of multiple tokens, suggesting a role somewhere between genuine believer and promotional amplifier. Active since late 2024, he has cultivated a modest but engaged following through high-volume engagement (16,519 favourites) and emotionally charged, mission-driven rhetoric. His identity is deeply tied to community loyalty, freedom narratives, and the BNB ecosystem.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037769360677244928/syvRxyT2_400x400.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',1779110981000,'99013863',1788127086711,1788127086711,20),
