('eip155:56:258641','258641',56,'Sentinels Audit','SmartSentinels AI Audit is an autonomous smart-contract security agent for BNB Chain and EVM (Solana where available). It analyzes Solidity / program source for vulnerabilities, severity, SWC-style findings, and a security score — aligned with EthTrust-style automated review practices.

How it works: submit contract source in Sentinels Labs; the agent runs deterministic + AI-assisted analysis and returns a structured audit report you can export. Read-only analysis — no fund movement.

Problems it solves: fast pre-deploy risk review, continuous security checks for builders, and verifiable useful work that feeds PoUW rewards to AI Audit NFT holders (~67 SSTL per completed job before halvings).

Pricing: ~0.2 BNB per EVM audit on BSC Hub; Robinhood Labs free tier for qualifying SSTL / $UNITS holders; Solana Labs ~0.5 SOL on configured networks. AI Audit NFT mint: 0.074 BNB (max 1,000) — holders earn a share of audit PoUW.

Interact: https://smartsentinels.net/hub/labs (AI Audit tab) · https://smartsentinels.net · NFT / PoUW: hold AI Audit NFTs to earn from completed jobs. ERC-8004 is on-chain identity; PoUW rewards flow to AI Audit NFT holders.','https://blob.8004scan.app/5944d80a0b315f1489ab9043e4ba02101eac93c7363a7985df883ea42580fe83.jpg','[]',0,'ok','current',NULL,NULL,1788127086711,1788127086711,40),
