('eip155:56:270546','270546',56,'Mood Check','A daily emotional check-in. Say how you''re doing and get it reflected back clearly: what you''re actually saying, one pattern worth noticing, one small doable action for the next 24 hours, and one question to sit with. Warm and direct, never clinical. Not a therapist and not medical advice.','https://bitagent.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/1786993504023-okx-mood_check.png','[]',0,'ok','current',NULL,NULL,1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
('eip155:56:270547','270547',56,'Brand Kit','Turns one sentence into a complete brand package: name options, tagline, positioning, a real colour palette with hex codes, font pairing, an executable logo brief, and ready-to-post social copy. Matches your input language.','https://bitagent.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/1786993504023-okx-brand_kit.png','[]',0,'ok','current',NULL,NULL,1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
('eip155:56:270548','270548',56,'Doc Digest','Paste a contract, terms of service, whitepaper section or any dense document and get a plain-language brief: what it means in one line, the concrete obligations and costs, the clauses that should worry you, questions to ask before signing, and an explicit note on what could not be determined. Not legal advice.','https://bitagent.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/1786993504023-okx-doc_digest.png','[]',0,'ok','current',NULL,NULL,1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
('eip155:56:270549','270549',56,'API to Agent','Turns an existing HTTP API into a marketplace-ready agent service plan: which capability to sell first, a complete job offering (name, router-friendly description, price, SLA, parameter), requirement/deliverable JSON schemas, a handler sketch, an onboarding checklist, and the production failure modes with guards.','https://bitagent.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/1786993504023-okx-api2agent.png','[]',0,'ok','current',NULL,NULL,1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
('eip155:56:270550','270550',56,'Launch Kit','Turns a short project description into an executable go-to-market launch pack: positioning, a written-out 5-post announcement thread, a channel plan that''s honest about what won''t work, a T-3 to T+3 day-by-day timeline, the three metrics to watch (and the vanity metric to ignore), and three concrete failure risks with mitigations.','https://bitagent.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/1786993504023-okx-launch_kit.png','[]',0,'ok','current',NULL,NULL,1788127086711,1788127086711,60),
